<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">ACT Ngulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">IMITENDELE</para>
  <para style="toc1">Imitendele ya Wegala Ulosi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Imitendele</para>
  <para style="toc3">Imit</para>
  <para style="mt1">IMITENDELE</para>
  <para style="mt2">YA WEGALA ULOSI</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOELO</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu che Imitendele ni simulizi za unk'hongo we fyo dya wahuwila wa Kilisito na ivo dyenele kulawa Yelusalemu na Uyahudi na Usamalia na mpaka si zose, enga viya Yesu ivo awagambile wanamp'hina wakwe aho andaga akei kuita kwe mbingu 1:8. Kitabu iki chawandikagwa ni Luka naho niye awandike Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Luka. Yehe andaga mganga naho andaga na wengele mwo kuwandika mbuli zilaile haheina kwazaganya. Vitabu ivi amuwandikilaga Teofilo uyo andaga Myunani, mna vitabu ivi naho vatailaga kwe want'hu wose, Wayunani na Wayahudi wamhuwile Kilisito 1:1.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikitabu iki che Imitendele chadahika chawandikagwa mwo lupisi lwo mwaka wa milongo mtandatu mpaka milongo mtandatu na mine kulawa aho Kilisito eze elekwe, kwaviya kitabu chabindilikila umwo mwigala Ulosi Paulo andaga akei kulawa kwe divugailo. Naho Luka atambaga na Paulo, ivo yadahika kitabu iki chawandikagwa mwo mzi wa Antiokia. Imitendele ni mgendelezo wa Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe na Luka naho chakongela hadya Yesu akaita kwe mbingu. Kitalo cha Luka kuwandika kitabu iki kiligana na kitalo kiya cho kuwandika Mbuli Yedi. Aungaga Teofilo hamwenga na want'hu wandaga wakongezekela awo wakumhuwila Kilisito wande ne ikindedi mwa kiya wakuhinizwa, ivo awandikaga haheina kwazaganya mwo wikazi wa Yesu no kwenela kwo mhuwi mwa Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu che Imitendele chakipatila mliganyizo we difyo dya want'hu wamhuwile Kilisito dya nk'hongo ivo dyandaga dikekala kwa mhuwi mwa Yesu. Na miliganyizo ya wegala Ulosi, yakilagisa suwe kukawiila ludole lwa Muye ywa Mnungu mwo kuugendeza Ulosi we Mbuli Yedi kwa want'hu watuhu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yemndani</para>
  <para style="io">Mwo mnango wa 1:1-8:1, Muye ywa Mnungu eza mwa wanamp'hina ne difyo dya want'hu wamhuwile Kilisito dyakonga kongezekela.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwo mnango wa 8:2-12:23, want'hu wamhuwile Kilisito wasulumizwa na kukonga kwenela isi nt'huhu kuse ya Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwo mnango wa 12:24-12:28, Paulo aita nt'hambo yakwe ya nk'hongo yo kubilikiza Mbuli Yedi.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwo mnango wa 15:1-35, Kitala kikulu chadugana ukwo Yelusalemu kulamula ni mbulizani zikuungwa kwa wahuwila wahya.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwo mnango wa 15:36-18:22, Paulo aita nt'hambo yakwe ya kaidi yo kubilikiza Mbuli Yedi.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwo mnango wa 18:23-20:38, Paulo aita nt'hambo yakwe ya katatu yo kubilikiza Mbuli Yedi.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwo mnango wa 15:1-35. Paulo agwiligwa ukwo Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwo mnango wa 27-28, Paulo egalwa Loma.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Kwa zumbe Teofilo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:1">Mwe kitabu changu che nk'hongo nehiwandika zimbuli zose adamanye Yesu no kuhiniza kwakwe, kulawa aho akongaga indima, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />no mpaka mwe dizuwa enuilagwa kuita kulanga. Umwo andaga akei kwinulwa kuita kulanga, awenk'haga sigilizi kwa udahi wa Muye ywa Mnungu wadya want'hu awasagulaga kunda wegala ulosi wakwe. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Wadya akelavilize kwawe kugamba emgima kwa sila nyingi eze abinde kusulumizwa kwakwe, akelaviliza kwawe kwa mazuwa milongo mine, naho alongaga nawo mbuli yo Useuta wa Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Naho Umwo wandaga hamwenga awenk'haga sigilizi ino, akawagamba. “Mse kuhalawa mwe Yelusalemu, mna gojeleni nt'hunyo idya niwagambileni, lagano Tate awaikilagani. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yohana abatizaga na mazi, mna mwa mazuwa mageke ya kwiza no mbatizwe kwa Muye ywa Mnungu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu enulwa kuita kulanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Umwo wanamp'hina wandaga hamwenga na Yesu, wamuuzaga wakamgamba, “Zumbe, togola ivi haluse nivo waunga uvuze useuta kwa want'hu wa Izilaeli?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Haimwenyu kumanya lupisi no msimo. Tate niye ayaikile mwo udahi wakwe.” <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Mna, nomhokele udahi umwo akawezilani Muye ywa Mnungu, nomnde walonga uwona wangu, mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu na mwe isi yose ya Yuda ne isi ya Samalia na mwe si zose. <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Eze abinde kulonga ivi, niyo enulwa kulanga iivi wakamsinya, niyo vunde dya mgubika iivi wakamkaula.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Umwo wandile wakei wenule meso yawe kulanga umwo Yesu andile akaita, wagosi waidi wavaile suke zing'aile mbe, wakimalaga hagihi yawe. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Niyo wawagamba, “Nyuwe want'hu wa Galilaya mkimalizwa nii aho mkakaula kulanga? Uyu Yesu aguhuhigwe kulawa mwenyu, naauye enga iivi mmuwone akaita kulanga.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matia asagulwa kunda hant'hu ha Yuda Isikali Yose</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:3-10">Matayo 27:3-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Niyo wanamp'hina wa Yesu wauya mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu kulawa kwo lugulu lwe Mizeituni, hana uhale wa lugendo lwa mazuwa mfungate kulawa kwo mzi. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Wengilaga mwo mzi no kwita mpaka kwe chumba ukwo nawakekala. Awo wandaga ni wakina Petulo na Yohana na Yakobo na Anduleya na Filipo na Tomasi na Batolomayo na Matayo na Yakobo mwana Alufayo hamwenga na Simoni akwitangwa “Mtowanila isi ya Izilaeli” na Yuda mwana Yakobo. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Awa wose wandaga wakamvika Mnungu hamwenga na wavele wamwenga, wakina Maliamu nine dya Yesu na wanduguze.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Mazuwa mageke kulongole kwandaga na mdugano wa wandugu wahuwila, wabulaga gana na milongo miidi woseni kwa hamwenga. Petulo akimalaga niyo agamba. <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Wandugu zangu wahuwila,” Mawandiko Yakukile aya yaungwa yakint'he, yudya Muye ywa Mnungu alongaga kombokela kwa Daudi mwe mbuli ya Yuda uyo awalongozaga wadya wamgwilaga Yesu, <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yuda andaga ni yumwenga mwe difyo dyetu, kwaviya naye asagulagwa kunda miyetu mwe ndima yetu.<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Na matundu yadya Yuda aguhaga kwa mbuli yo wiihi wakwe agulaga mgunda aho agwaga no kubanika, atulikaga izinda niyo utumbo wakwe wafant'hukila kuse. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Want'hu wose nawakekala Yelusalemu waivaga imbuli iyo, na ivo mwe milosi yawe wenye wawitanga mgunda udya Akelidama, nuko kugamba “Mgunda ya sakame”.<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />“Kwaviya nivo iwandikwe mwe kitabu che Zabuli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Nyumba yakwe neinde heiina kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">isekwikalwa ni mnt'hu yeyose.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Naho iwandikwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Hant'hu hakwe nahaguhigwe ni mtuhu.’<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21-22" />“Naivo mtuhu naaungwe kukelunga na suwe, kwo ulonga uwona, wo uuyulo wa Zumbe Yesu. Uyo aungwa kunda ni yumwenga mo umwenga wetu kukongela umwo Zumbe Yesu andaga hamwenga na suwe, kukongela kudya Yohana andaga akabilikiza ulosi wo ubatizi, mpaka mwe dizuwa aguhilagwa Yesu kulanga kulawa kwetu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Ivo niyo walavilizwa want'hu waidi, Yusufu etangagwa Balisaba, zina tuhu Yusito, ywa kaidi ni Matiya. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Niyo wamlombeza Mnungu wakagamba, “Zumbe kumanya fanyanyi za kila mnt'hu, ivo kilagise ni yuhi mwa awa waidi uyo umsagule <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />adamanye ndima ya wigala ulosi hant'hu ha Yuda uyo ahalekaga niyo aita hant'hu awagilwe kunda.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Niyo wadamanya usaguzi mwa waidi awo, asagulagwa andaga ni Matiya, naivo niyo awazigwa kunda hamwenga na wegala ulosi mlongo na yumwenga.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Wiziilo wa Muye ywa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Dizuwa dye Pent'hekosite dize dibule, wahuwila wose waduganaga hant'hu hamwenga. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Aaho niyo halaila mvumilo kulawa mwo ulanga mvumilo enga peho kulu dikuvumila, niyo dya memeza inyumba yose mdya wandile wakekala. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Niyo waona enga ndilija za moto zitilwe niyo zawekaila kila yumwenga ywawe. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Wose wamemezagwa ni Muye ywa Mnungu, na kukonga kulonga kwa milosi mituhu, enga ivo Muye ywa Mnungu awenk'haga udahi wo kulonga.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Kwandaga na Wayahudi uko Yelusalemu, wandaga wakamvika Mnungu, walawaga mwe kila isi. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Weze weve divumilo diya dikulu niyo wakeduganya. Wose wehelwagwa kwaviya kila yumwenga ywawe awevaga wahuwila wakalonga kwa milosi yawe wenye. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Kwa kwehelwa no kuhungila, niyo wagamba, “Togola want'hu awa wakulonga enga ivi hiyo Wagalilaya! <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Yanda vivihi suwe choseni chaweva ivo wakulonga, mwe milosi yetu wenye? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Suwe kilawa Pasia wamwenga Media na Waelamu na watuhu ni wakaya wa Mesopotamia na Yuda na Kapadokia na Ponto na Asia, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />wamwenga kulawa Filigia na a Pamfilia, wamwenga kulawa Misili na nt'hendelo za Libiya hagihi na Silene, wamwenga mwa suwe ni kulawa Lumi, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />want'hu woseni, Wayahudi na want'hu hi Wayahudi watendigwe kutimila dini ye Kiyahudi, naho wamwenga wetu walawa Kilete na kwa Waalabu, mna suwe chose kikei cheva walonga mwe milosi yetu udamanyi mkulu wa Mnungu!” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Wehelwagwa no kwaganikilwa, niyo wakeuza kila yumwenga wakagamba, “Ino niyo imbwai?”<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Mna wamwenga niyo wawabela wakagamba, “Want'hu awa wakozi!”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa Petulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Mna Petulo akimaalaga hamwenga na wadya wegala ulosi mlongo na yumwenga, naho kwa izwi kulu niyo akonga kulonga ne difyo diya dya want'hu akagamba, “Wambuya zangu Wayahudi, na nyuwe nyose mkwikala mwe Yelusalemu, nitegelezeni niwagambileni ino niyo imbwai. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Want'hu awa hiyo wakozi enga ivo mkuwafanyanya, ivi haluse ni mtondo wa saa nt'hatu. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Naho ino niyo alongaga Mlotezi Yoeli.<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />Mnungu agambaga, ‘Ivo nivo nenitende mwa mazuwa yo kubindiliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">nenigele Muye ywa Mnungu, mwa want'hu wose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Wana kilume na wakike nawabilikize ulosi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">wana wenyu we kilume nawaone maona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">na wadala wenyu nawalote sozi.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Heiye, hata mwa wandima wangu, wagosi na wavele, nenitile Muye ywangu mwa mazuwa ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">nawabilikize mbuli yangu.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Nenidamanye vilagiso mnanga mo ulanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">na vilagiso hasi he isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">No kunde sakame, moto na zosi dizamile,<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Zuwa nedigeligwe lwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">no mnenge nawo noudumile unk'hundu enga sakame</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">wiziilo we dizuwa dikulu dyo ukulu wa Zumbe umwo dikanda dikei kwiza.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Aho yeyose naamwitange Zumbe kwa wambizi, naayokolwe.’<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />“Tegelezeni zimbuli izi nyuwe wambuya zangu we Kiizilaeli! Yesu wa Nazaleti andaga mnt'hu mta udahi ulawile kwa Mnungu ulavilizwe kwenyu kwa vihungi no kweheela kudamanywe ni Mnungu kombokela kwakwe. Nyuwe wenye ni waona wa aya, kwaviya yalailaga mwenyu. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Kwaviya aungile mwenye Mnungu, Yesu nakaungwa kugeligwa mwe mikono yenyu, naho mwamkomaga kwa kuwalekela want'hu wata wavu wamkome kwa kumuwamba mo msalaba. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Mna Mnungu amuuyulaga no kumtenda kunda mlekelwa mo usungu we file, kwaviya havadahike file imtozeleze. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Kwaviya Daudi alongaga mwa yehe kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Himuona Zumbe kanilongoela mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">yehe ehagihi na miye ivo henizingize.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Na ivo miye himema kwelelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">ne zimbuli zangu zimema kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">hata handa no mwili wo kubanika</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">nenikale kwa kukawiila,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />kwaviya weye Mnungu hounase mwe isi ya wazimu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:27">houmlekele mtumwa ywako Akukile aowele kwe kikuta.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Kunilagisa miye sila ikunilongoza kwo ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:28">naho undiilo wako, nounimemeze kinyemi.’<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />“Wambuya zangu, niwagambileni haheina kogoha, zimbuli zo mkale ywetu mkulu Daudi, abanikaga niyo amoswa msanga, naho kikuta chakwe kiaha hetu hata mwa mazuwa aya. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Daudi andaga mlotezi, naho amanyaga kiya Mnungu alagisaga kwa kilapi, Mnungu amwikilaga kilapi kugamba naamwink'he yumwenga mwo welekwa wakwe kunda seuta enga viya Daudi andaga. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Daudi amanyaga kiya Mnungu nakaunga adamanye kulongole, na ivo asimuilaga imbuli yo kuuyuka kwa Kilisito Mkombozi asagulwe ni Mnungu umwo akagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">‘Haasigale mwe isi ya wazimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">mwili wakwe mwe kikuta.’<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Mnungu nakamuuyula Yesu, naswe kiwalonga uwona we kindedi iki. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Kenulwa na kuikwa mwo Useuta wa Mnungu, Ise, naho ahokelaga Muye ywa Mnungu kulawa kwakwe, enga viya amwikilaga ndagano. Iki mkukiona no kukiva ivi haluse niye nt'hunyo difumbiilwe ni Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Kwaviya Daudi hiyo yehe enulwe kulanga, mna niye agambaga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Zumbe amgambaga Zumbe dyangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">Ikala kulume kwangu<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />mpaka niwaike wank'hondo wako hasi ye viga vako.’<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />“Want'hu wose wa Izilaeli, wamanye ikindedi kugamba yudya Yesu Kilisito mwa muwambaga mwo msalaba niye atendigwe ni Mnungu kunda Zumbe na Mkombozi!”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Want'hu weze weve ivo, niyo wengilwa ni kinyulu mwe mioyo yawe nokumgamba Petulo na wegala ulosi watuhu, “Haluse wandugu zetu, kitende vivihi?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Petulo niyo awahitula kugamba, “Kila yumwenga ahituke kulawa mo wavu, no kubatizwa mwe dizina dya Yesu Kilisito, vileke muusilwe wavu wenyu, niho nomhokele geleko dya Muye ywa Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Kwaviya indagano aikile Mnungu ni kwa nyuwe na wana wenyu na wose wehale, wose wetangwe ni Zumbe Mnungu kwakwe mwenye.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Petulo abilikizaga kwa milosi mingi awakanyaga akagamba, “Keyokoleni nyuwe wenye kulawa mwa maya ya Mnungu yakukiziila cheleko iki cho wavu!” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Wengi wahuwilaga mo ulosi wakwe niyo wabatizwa, want'hu wabuile magana milongo mitatu nawongezekela mwe dizuwa idyo. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Niyo wanda wakahinizwa ni wegala ulosi, wekalaga hamwenga mwe midugano ya wahuwila, wakabendula mkate no kumvika Mnungu.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wikazi wa Wahuwila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Vihungi vingi na va kwehela nevikadamanywa ni wegala ulosi, kila yumwenga niyo engilwa ni wogofi. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Wahuwila wose wagendeelaga kunda hamwenga na kuhangila vint'hu vawe kwa kila yumwenga. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Na wakataga vint'hu, no ugoli wawe na kukepangila matundu kuligana na viya kila yumwenga naakaviunga. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Kila zuwa dikutimila na wakadugana enga viya fyo mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu, naho nawakadya ndala, wakadya kwa kinyemi na mioyo ya ukise, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />wakamtogola Mnungu no kuwatende want'hu wose welelwe. Naho kila zuwa Zumbe naakawagenyeza kwe difyo dyawe, kwa wadya nawakayokolwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Mnt'hu aholomp'hale ahonywa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Zuwa dimwenga Petulo na Yohana wandaga wakaita hamwenga kwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu saa kenda kisingi, mwe sa yo kumvika Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Hadya he Nk'hili Int'hana enga ivo ikwitangwa, handaga na mnt'hu aholomp'hale viga mo wikazi wakwe wose. Mazuwa yose naakegalwa kwe nk'hili akalombeze matundu kulawa kwa want'hu wandaga wakaita kwe Nyumba ya Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Eze awaone Petulo na Yohana wakengila mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, awalombezaga wamwink'he chochose. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Petulo na Yohana wamkaulisaga mnt'hu uyo, niyo Petulo amgamba, “Kikaule suwe!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Ivo niyo awakaulisa akakawiila kwink'higwa chochose. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Mna Petulo amgambaga, “Miye hina matundu, mna nakwink'ha kiya nnanacho, kwe dizina dya Yesu Kilisito ywa Nazaleti, nakugamba Kimala ugende!” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Niyo amwinula kwa mkono wakwe wo kulume, no kumwambiza akimale. Aaho iviga ne zink'hungu ze viga vakwe vapataga ludole. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Niyo apilika no kukimala ne viga vakwe, naho niyo akonga kugenda genda, niyo engila nawo kwe Nyumba ya Mnungu, akagenda na kupilika pilika akamtogola Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Want'hu nawamuona akagenda no kumtogola Mnungu, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />naho umwo weze wamuwone kugamba ni yudya kilombezi andaga akekala he nk'hili ikwitangwa Nnk'hili Nt'hana, wose weehelagwa na kuhungwa mwe kiya kimlaile yudya mnt'hu.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa Petulo mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Umwo yudya mnt'hu andaga hamwenga nawo Petulo na Yohana, want'hu wose weheelesagwa, naivo niyo wawagulukila hant'hu hakwitangwa ho ukumbi wa Sulemani. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Petulo eze awaone awant'hu niyo awagamba, Wandugu zetu wa Izilaeli, nii mwehelwa mwe mbuli ino, naho nii mwakikaulisa suwe? Nyuwe mwagamba aya yadamanyika kwa udahi wetu suwe, hegu kwo uwedi kinanao kimtenda mnt'hu uyu agende? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Mnungu ywa Ibulahimu na ywa Isaka na ywa Yakobo na Mnungu ywa wakale wetu, kamwink'ha ukulu mtumwa ywakwe Yesu, mna no mumgela mwe mikono ya maseuta, niyo mwamlemela hameso ha Pilato, hata hadya Pilato aungaga amlekele. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Nakanda mnt'hu akukile naho azumilwe ni Mnungu, mna mwamlemelaga, vitendese no mumlombeza Pilato awambizeni kumlekela yudya mkomi. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Nomumkoma yudya akulongoza kwita kwo ugima mna Mnungu nakamuuyula, naswe nisuwe kiyaone ayo. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Nu udahi we dizina dyakwe umgeile ludole uyu mnt'hu agende. Uyu mkumuona mummanya kadamanyilwa ayo kwa mhuwi kwa zina dya Yesu, nu mhuwi mwa Yesu nuwo umhonyile, enga ivo nyose mkudaha kuwona.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Naho elo, ndugu zangu, hiyamanya yadya mumdamanyile Yesu nyuwe ne vilongozi wenyu, mdamanya kwaviya nomnda hamanyize. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Mnungu ayalongaga kombokela walotezi wakwe kugamba Kilisito Mkombozi nasulumizwe, naho haluse kayatenda yadamanyike kwe sila ino. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Kweiileni, mumhitukile Mnungu, vileke Mnungu awausile wavu wenyu. Mnatenda ivo, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />lupisi va kugeligwa ludole nolwize kulawa kwa Zumbe, naho naawegaileni Yesu uyo Kilisito Mkombozi msaguilwe. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Neekale uko kulanga mpaka Umwo vikabubula aho vint'hu vose nevidamanywe uhya, enga viya Mnungu alongile kombokela kwa walotezi wakwe awo wandaga uuko kale. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Kwaviya Musa agambaga, ‘Zumbe Mnungu wenyu naawasaguileni mlotezi mgati mwa wandugu zenyu enga ivo anigale miye, naho naande yumwenga mwa want'hu wa kwenyu, muyategeleze yose naawagambileni myadamanye. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Uneva mnt'hu yeyose hana mtegeleze mlotezi uyo, naalavigwe kulawa mwa want'hu wa Mnungu niyo kukomwa.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Walotezi wose wandile no ulosi, Samweli na wose wamtimile woho nawo walongaga iki kikulaila mwa mazuwa aya. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Ndagano za Mnungu kwombokela kwa walotezi wakwe ni kwa nyuwe, naho mwihamwenga mwe yadya Mnungu alagane na wakale wenyu. Enga ivo alongaga na Ibulahimu, ‘Kombokela kwo lukolo neniwavikile want'hu wose mwe isi.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Naivo Mnungu kamsagula mtumwa ywakwe naho nk'hongo kamwigala kwenyu, kuwavikila kwa kuwatenda kila yumwenga ywenyu kuhituka kulawa mwe zisila zenyu ziihile.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Petulo na Yohana waikwa he kitala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Petulo na Yohana wandaga wakei kusimuila na want'hu umwo walava nt'hambiko na Mkulu wa wamizi we Nyumba ya Mnungu hamwenga na Masadukayo waweziilaga. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Wandaga na maya kwaviya wegala ulosi awa waidi wawahinizaga want'hu kugamba Yesu auyukaga, kikwigala uwona kugamba, wabanike nawauyuke. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Ivo niyo wawagwila nokuwavugaila mpaka zuwa ditimile, kwaviya zuwa nediswa. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Mna wose wawivaga uwo ulosi wahuwilaga, naho mwa awo wagosi du wandaga milongo magana mashano.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Mwe dizuwa dya kaidi, vilongozi wa Wayahudi na wadala vilongozi hamwenga na wahinizi wa sigilizi, wakeduganyaga mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Waduganaga hamwenga na Mlava nt'hambiko Mkulu Anasi, hamwenga na Kayafa na Yohana, na Alekizanda hamwenga na watuhu we nyumba yo Ulava nt'hambiko Mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Wawaikaga Wegala Ulosi, Petulo na Yohana hameso yawe niyo wawauza, “Mwayadamanya aya kwa ludole lwani? Naho kwa udahi wa dizina dyaani?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Petulo akanda kamema Muye ywa Mnungu, niyo awahitula, “wadala Vilongozi wa want'hu, na wakulu, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />uneva kiletwa dielo nakuuzwa kilonge izimbuli izedi adamanyilwe uyo aholomp'hale, naivo ahonyigwe, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />nyuwe nyose hamwenga na want'hu wose wa Izilaeli mmanye. Mnt'hu uyu akimale iivi mkasinya, mgima ngungulu, kwa zina dya Yesu Kilisito ywa Nazaleti, yudya mwamuwambaga mo msalaba, uyo auyulwe ni Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Uyu Yesu niye yudya awandikagwa mwo Mawandiko Yakukile kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">‘Diiwe diya mwadilemelaga nyuwe wazesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">dinda iwe kulu hediikuungwa kusweswa kujink'ha yose.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Uyokozi walawa kwa yehe ekedu, mwe isi yose hadihali zina dyodyose hasi ye mbingu kink'higwe ni Mnungu dikudaha kukiyokola.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Want'hu we kitala weheelegwa kuuona weduvi wa Petulo na Yohana, nokubunk'hula kugamba wandaga ni enga want'hu watuhu wose ivo weli, naho heweina umanyi. Wabunk'hulaga naho kugamba wandaga hamwenga na Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Mna hawandaga na dyodyose wadahile kulonga kwaviya nawamuona yudya mnt'hu ahonile kakimala hamwenga na wakina Petulo na miyawe Yohana. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Ivo niyo wawagamba wafose kuse ye kitala, niyo vilongozi we kitala cha Wayahudi wakonga kutalaula wohowenye. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Wakeuzaga wenye wakagamba, “Nekitende vivihi mwa want'hu awa?” “Kila mnt'hu mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu kamanya kia kihungi kikulu kidamanywe ni Petulo na Yohana, naho hakikudaha kukilemela. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Mna chaungwa kuwafingiza want'hu awa wasekulonga naho na mnt'hu yeyose kwa zina dya Yesu, vileke imbuli ino ise kugendesa mwe isi yose.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Ivo niyo wawetanga naho kwe nyumba no kuwafingiza kugamba wasekulonga naho mwekieti hegu kuhiniza kwa zina dya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Mna Petulo na Yohana niyo wawahitula kugamba, “Lamuleni nyuwe kiya ichedi kikwelela ha meso ya Mnungu, kuwatimilani nyuwe hegu kumtimila Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Kwaviya hakikudaha kuleka kulonga kiya kikione na kukiva suwewenye.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Ivo vilongozi we kitala wagendeelaga kuwafingiziza, niyo chawalekela. Nawaona kugamba nevinda vidala kuwasulumiza, kwaviya want'hu nawakamwink'ha ukulu Mnungu kwe kiya kilaile. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Yudya mnt'hu adamanyilwe ikihungi andaga na myaka ijink'hile milongo mine.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wahuwila walomlombeza Mnungu awenk'he weduvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Aaho Petulo na Yohana weze walekelwe, wauyaga kwa weyawe no kuwagambila kiya wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na wadala vilongozi ivo walongile. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Umwo wahuwila weze weve ivo, wakeduganyaga hamwenga kwa kumlombeza Mnungu kwa moyo umwenga wakagamba, “Zumbe Muumbi wo ulanga ne isi ne bahali na vose vimndani mwawe! <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Walongaga no mkale ywetu Daudi, mtumwa ywako, kwa udahi wa Muye ywa ywako, ukagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">‘Nii want'hu we isi yose waihiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">nii want'hu waikaga minyanyiko ya kihezi?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Mazumbe we isi wakeika lumwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">vilongozi nao wakeduganya hamwenga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">wakamhiga Zumbe na Kilisito Mkombozi amsagule.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Kwaviya ikindedi Helode na Pontio Pilato waduganaga mwo mzi hamwenga na want'hu hi Wayahudi na want'hu wa Izilaeli kumhiga Yesu, Mndima ywako Akukile, uyo umsagule, Kilisito Mkombozi. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Nawadamanya kila kint'hu kiya ukiikile lumwe kwa udahi no kuunga kwako kugamba nekilaile. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Naho haluse, weye Zumbe, kaula ukutisa kwawe, naho ukizumile suwe wandima wako, kibilikize ulosi wako kwa kukeduvya. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Chulula mkono wako uwahonye want'hu, naho damanya vilagiso va na kwehela kwa kombokela zina dyo mtumwa ywako Yesu Akukile.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Weze wabinde kulombeza Mnungu, hadya wandile niyo hasingisika. Wose hadya niyo wamemezwa Muye ywa Mnungu no kubilikiza Mbuli ya Mnungu kwa weduvi.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wahuwila wahangila vint'hu wananavo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Fyo dya wahuwila wandaga wamwenga mwe zifanyanyi zawe na mwe mioyo yawe. Hakwandile na yeyose adahile kugamba kint'hu chakwe mwenye, ila wahangilaga vint'hu vose wandaga navo. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Kwa udahi mkulu wegala ulosi walavaga uwona mwe mbuli yo kuuyuka kwa Zumbe Yesu, naho niyo Mnungu awenk'ha uwedi mwingi. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Mwo umwenga wawe hakwandaga na yumwenga andaga na uswesi wa kint'hu. Wamwenga wandaga na vint'hu vawe wavitagaga no kwink'hiza matundu yalaile mwediyombe, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />nokuzink'hiza kwa wegala ulosi, naho matundu nayapangigwa kwa kila mnt'hu kuligana viya akuviunga.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Kwandaga na Mlawi yuwenga mwelekwa ywa Kipulo, akwitangwa Yusufu, uyo wegala ulosi wakumwitanga Banaba nuko kugamba “Mgela moyo want'hu”, <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />atagaga nk'hode yakwe, niyo kuyaguha matundu nokuyenk'hiza kwa wegala ulosi.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Anania na mkaziwe Safila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Kwandaga na mnt'hu yumwenga etangagwa Anania, hamwenga na mkaziwe Safila, nao watagaga mgunda wawe. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Anania afisaga matundu yamwenga, mkaziwe naye amanyaga, niyo enk'hiza yadya yasigale kwa wegala ulosi. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Petulo niyo amgamba, “Anania, nii ukamlekela Mwavu umoyo wako, niyo wamdant'hiliza Muye ywa Mnungu kwa kufisa matundu yamwenga uyapatile mokutaga umgunda wako? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Umwo wandile ukei kuutaga mgunda, nounda wako, naho hata wize uutage matundu nayanda yako. Haluse nii ukapata ulamuzi wa kudamanya ivo? Huwadant'hilize want'hu, mna kumdant'hiliza Mnungu!” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Aaho Anania eze eve ivo, niyo agwa hasi no kubanika. Want'hu wose wevaga imbuli iyo wengilagwa niwogofi mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Wabwanga wezaga no kuuvika sanda kimba chakwe no kugenda kukizika uko kuse.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Lupisi lwa masaa matatu ivi, mkaziwe nakengila mwe nyumba idya akanda hamanyize chochose kilaile. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Petulo niyo amgamba, “Nigambile, matundu aya nayo ye diyombe dye kindedi mtagile umgunda?” Yudya mvele niyo amhitula, “Heiye, naayo.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Ivo Petulo niyo amuuza Yudya mvele, “Nii weye na mgosiyo mwivana kumgeza Muye ywa Zumbe? Want'hu wammosaga msanga mgosiyo weyaha homnango, naho nawakwinule weye nawe!” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Aaho yudya mvele niyo agwa no kubanika. Wadya wabwanga niyo weza no kuwona kugamba nakafa, ivo niyo wamwinula no kummosa msanga hagihi na mgosiwe. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Fyo dya wahuwila wa Kilisito dyose na want'hu watuhu nawengilwa ni wogofi.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vihungi no kwehela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Vihungi vingi na vakwehela nevikadamanywa ni wegala ulosi mgati mwa want'hu. Wahuwila wose nawakadugana kwa moyo umwenga mwo ukumbi wa Sulemani. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Hakwandile na yeyose wakuse ye dibunga agezile kukelunga nawo hata vandile want'hu nawaka walongela vedi.<verse eid="ACT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Mna want'hu wengi wagosi na wavele nawakelunga mwe difyo dyao, nokutenda fyo dya wakumhuwila Zumbe dyongezekela. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Niyo vanda mwa yadya nayakadamanywa ni wegala ulosi, wanyonge nawakenulwa mwe zisila no kuikwa mwe vigonelo vileke kizuli du cha Petulo kiwagubike wamwenga umwo akomboka. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Naho mafyo ya want'hu yezaga kulawa kwe mizi izunguluke Yelusalemu, wakawegala wose wandile wakalumwa, wadya wandile na mp'hepo, na wose wahonyagwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagela Ulosi wasunk'wasunk'wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko, hamwenga na want'hu wose we dibunga dya Masadukayo, niyo wengila finju kwe wegala ulosi, ivo nawalamula kuwa tendela vihile. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Nawawagwila wegala ulosi niyo wawagela kwe divugailo. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Mna kilo ikia mtumigwa ywa Zumbe akomolaga ulwivi lwe divugailo, na kuwalava kuse wegala ulosiwa, niyo awagamba, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Iteni mkakimale kwe Nyumba ya Mnungu, muwagambile want'hu mbuli zose zo ugima mhya.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Wagela Ulosi niyo watoza isigilizi, iviya kisingi wengilaga kwe Nyumba ya Mnungu no kukonga kuhiniza. Wakulu wa walava Nt'hambiko hamwenga na weyawe, wawetangaga want'hu wose we kitala na wadala vilongozi we Kiizilaeli, niyo wasigila uko kwe divugailo kuwaguha wegala ulosi no kuwaleta hameso yawe. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Mna wamizi we Nyumba ya Mnungu weze wabule, hawawaonaga wegala ulosi awo mwe divugailo, ivo wauyaga kwe Kitala no kuwagambila, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />“Kize kibule kwe divugailo nekidibwila divugailo divugalwa ndindili, naho wamizi wose nawanda meso mwe zink'hili, mna kize kikomole zinyivi hakione mnt'hu yeyose kundani!” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Umwo Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na yudya mkulu wa wamizi we Nyumba ya Mnungu weze weve ivo, na weheelwa kugamba wegala ulosi wadigwa nii. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Niho aweziilaga mnt'hu akawagamba, “Tegelezeni! Want'hu wadya muwavugaile kwedivugailo wekwe Nyumba ya Mnungu, wahiniziza want'hu!” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Ivo mkulu wa wamizi, hamwenga na want'hu wakwe, wagendaga kuwavuza kwa mp'hahalahole kwaviya wogohaga want'hu sema wana watowe maiwe.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Wawengizaga kundani, na kuwakimalisa hameso ye kitala, niyo mkulu wa walava nt'hambiko awauza mbuli wegala ulosi. <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />Niyo awagamba, “Nyuwe nekiwalemezesa mse kubilikiza kwa dizina dyo mnt'hu uyu. Mna kauleni ivo mdamanye! Mgendeza mahinizo yenyu mwe Yelusalemu yose, naho mwaunga mkitende kugamba suwe nisuwe kimkomile!”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Niyo Petulo na wegala ulosi weyawe wahitula, “Chaungwa kumwogoha Mnungu, hiyo mnt'hu. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Mnungu ywa wakale wetu amuuyulaga Yesu aho nyuwe mwize mumkome kwa kuhweleza mwo mti. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Mnungu amwikaga mwe nt'hunyo yakwe kwa kumtenda kilongozi na mlokozi, kuwenk'ha Wazilaeli luneka lwa kweiila no kuusilwa wavu wawe. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Nisuwe kikulonga uwona we zimbuli izi, hamwenga na Muye ywa Mnungu, uyo niye enk'hizwe kwa wose wakumwiva Mnungu.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Wadya want'hu we kitala weze weve ivo niyo wafa maya, wakaunga wawakome wadya wegala ulosi. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Mna yumwenga mwa Mafalisayo etangagwa Gamalieli andaga mhinizi wa sigilizi, naho uyo azumilagwa vitendese ni want'hu wose, akimaalaga he Kitala, niyo awagambaga wegala ulosi wande kufosa kuse ludodo. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Niyo awagamba want'hu we Kitala, “Wambuyazangu Waizilaeli mnde na wengele kwa kia mkuunga muwadamanyile want'hu awa. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Mwakumbukila kugamba alailaga Teuda mazuwa yomboke akaketogola kunda mnt'hu mkulu, niyo want'hu wabulaga magana mane wamzumilaga na kukelunga naye, Mna niyo akomwa, wose nawakamtimila niyo wa mwaganika, kafyo kakwe niyo kaganika. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Akajika naho, niyo alaila Yuda ywa Wagalilaya, mo kuwaza want'hu, uyu naye apataga want'hu wabindile wingi mna naye akomagwa, niyo want'hu wamtimila wamwaganika. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Naivo nawagambilani, mwe mbuli ino msekuwatenda dyodyose want'hu awa, walekeni wenye. Uneva iki wakudamanya chalawa mwe zifanyanyi za want'hu, nekisunguze kwaganika, <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />mna uneva ni cha Mnungu, homdahe kuwafingiza, kwaviya nomkebwiile mmo kuhigana na Mnungu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Kitala chatimilaga milosi ya Gamalieli. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Wawetangaga naho awo wegala ulosi, niyo wawatowa mikotya, no kuwafingiza wase kuhiniza naho kwe dizina dya Yesu niyo wawalekela. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Wagela Ulosi weze wafose mwe kitala wandaga na kinyemi kwaviya Mnungu awenk'haga kuwagilwa kugeligwa soni kwajili ye dizina dya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Naho mazuwa yose mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu na mwe zinyumba za want'hu, wegala ulosi wagendeelaga kuhiniza no kubilikiza Mbuli Yedi ya Yesu Kilisito kugamba niye Mkombozi asagulwe.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Wambizi mfungate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Ize yajike aho, enga ivo wanamp'hina nawakongezekela, kwa swesaga muivano mwa Wayahudi wakulonga Kigiliki, na Waibulania. Wayahudi wakulonga Kigiliki nawakalabila kugamba wavele wakwawe wabanikilwe na walume zawe, wajaligwa mwo upasi we nk'hande wa kila zuwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Kwa ivo wadya wegala ulosi mlongo na waidi niyo wetanga idifyo digima dya wanamp'hina wose na kuwagamba, haviwagilwe kwa suwe kuleka kubilikiza mbuli ya Mnungu, vileke kikaule mbuli yo upasi we vint'hu. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Elo wandugu zetu, saguleni want'hu mfungate mwa nyuwe wamanyike kunda na Muye ywa Mnungu no umanyi, nekiwaike kunda wakimalizi we mbuli ino yo upasi. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Naivo suwe nekinde ne ndima yo kumlombeza Mnungu no kubilikiza.<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Fyo dyose dyelelagwa ne zifanyanyi za wegala ulosi, niyo wawasagula Sitefano mnt'hu mta mhuwi mkulu na Muye ywa Mnungu na Filipo na Pulokola na Nikono na Timoni na Palamena hamwenga na Nikolasi hi myahudi kulawa Antiokia, uyo atendagwa kunda mwe dini ye Kiyahudi aho nk'hongo. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Kafyo ako kegalagwa kwa wegala ulosi, niyo wegala ulosi wawageleka mikono no kuwavikila.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Naivo mbuli ya Mnungu yageendelaga kugendezwa, wanamp'hina mwe Yelusalemu wagenyelaga na kugenyela, naho walava nt'hambiko wabindile ingi wamhuwilaga Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugwiligwa kwa Sitefano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Sitefano enk'hagwa uwedi wa Mnungu vitendese na kwink'hwa udahi ni Mnungu, adamanyaga vilagiso na kweheela mwa want'hu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Mna na ahigagwa ni want'hu wamwenga we nyumba yo mviko neiketangwa nyumba ya walekelwa, yawaduganyaga hamwenga Wayahudi kulawa Kilene, na Alekizandilia. Awa wandaga Wayahudi wandaga watumwa, mna wenk'hagwa ulekelwa wawe. Vandaga ni hamwenga na Wayahudi kulawa Kilene na Ekizandilia. Woho na wayahudi watuhu kulawa mikoa ya Kilikia na Asia wakongaga kuhigana na Sitefano. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Mna Muye ywa Mnungu amwink'haga Sitefano umanyi wedi naho umwo andile akalonga, hawadahile kumhuma. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Ivo wazungulaga want'hu no kuwenk'ha matundu vileke walonge lulimi kugamba, “Nekimwiva akambela vihile Musa na kumbela Mnungu!” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Kwa ivo na wakasongeleza want'hu, wadala vilongozi, na wahinizi wa miko ya Musa. Wamgwilaga Sitefano kumwigala kwe Kitala. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Niyo wetanga want'hu kwiza kulonga udant'hi mwa Sitefano. Niyo wagamba, “Mnt'hu uyu hakuleka kuibela vihile Nyumba ikukile ya Mnungu, hamwenga ne miko ya Musa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Chamwivaga akagamba, uyu Yesu wa Nazaleti naaimole Inyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu no kuihitula miko yose kiihokele kwa Musa!” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Wose wekalaga he kitala wamn'goelaga meso Sitefano no kuwona kugamba ifuta yakwe yang'alaga enga futa ya mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Utambalisi wa Sitefano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Mlava nt'hambiko Mkulu amuuzaga Sitefano, “Iki kindedi?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Sitefano niyo ahitula, “Wandugu zangu, nitegelezeni! Umwo mkale ywetu Ibulahimu andaga akei kuita uko Halani, Mnungu ywo ukulu amlailaga uko Mesopotamia <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />niyo amgamba, ‘Waleke want'hu wako ne isi yako naho uite kwe isi huunga hulagise.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Ibulahimu ailekaga isi yakwe ya Wakalidayo niyo agenda kwikala Halani. Aho ise dya Ibulahimu eze abanike, Mnungu amtendaga Ibulahimu asogele mwe isi ino mkwikala ivi haluse. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Mnungu hamwink'haga hohose mwe isi iyo kunda hakwe hata hant'hu hadodo mwe isi, Mna Mnungu amwikilaga ndagano kumwink'ha isi iyo, naho iyo neikanda yakwe hamwenga ne cheleko chakwe. Umwo Mnungu aikaga indagano iyo Ibulahimu andaga heina mwana. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Naivi nivo alongaga Mnungu kwa Ibulahimu, ‘Cheleko chako nekikale kutanga, naho uko nawande watumwa, naho nawatendelwe yaihile kwa myaka milongo mine. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Mna nenombose usengelo kwa wadya wa kuwatendani watumwa, Mnungu kagamba, akajika nenikilave cheleko chenyu mwe isi iyo naivo nawanivike miye hant'hu aha.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Niyo Mnungu atenda wila wa kumvina Ibulahimu kunda kilagiso che ndagano. Ivo Ibulahimu niyo amvina Isaka mazuwa mtandatu du eze elekwe, Isaka niyo eza kumvina mwanawe Yakobo, Yakobo naye niyo eza kuwavina wadya wanawe mlongo na waidi, awakale wo lukolo lwetu.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Wana Yakobo wamuwonelaga finju ndugu ywawe Yusufu niyo wamtaga kwo utumwa uko Misili. Mna Mnungu andaga hamwenga naye Yusufu, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />niyo amkombola mwa makunt'ho yakwe. Mnungu amwink'haga Yusufu uwedi wakwe na umanyi hameso ya seuta ywa Misili akwitangwa Seuta ywa Misili, Yudya Seuta ywa Misili niyo amtenda Yusufu kunda mkulu mwe isi na mwe nyumba yakwe yose. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Niyo kwalaila gumbo kulu mwe isi ya Misili ne isi ya Kanani, yawatendaga wakale wetu kunda na makunt'ho makulu. Wakale wetu hawadahaga kupata chochose cho kudya. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Yakobo eze eve kugamba Misili kuna nk'hande, niyo awatuma wadya wanawe awo wakale wetu, waite Misili malavo yao ya nk'hongo. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Mwe nt'hambo yawe ya kaidi Yusufu akelavanyaga kwa wanduguze, Seuta ywa Misili niyo aimanya imp'huga ya Yusufu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Yusufu egalaga want'hu kwa ise Yakobo, amgambile hamwenga ne mp'huga yose, uwazilo wawe wandaga ni milongo mfungate na shano, weze Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Ivo Yakobo aitaga Misili yehe hamwenga na wakale wetu watuhu, na uko nuko wafiilaga. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Vimba vawe vegalagwa mpaka Shekemu, niyo wamosigwa msanga mwe kikuta agulaga Ibulahimu kwa want'hu wa kabila dya Hamoli kwa matundu heyemanyike uwazilo wakwe.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Want'hu wetu kudya Misili wagenyelaga niyo wanda wabindile ingi aho Mnungu andaga akaunga akint'hize indagano yakwe aikaga na Ibulahimu. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Kulongole, seuta yumwenga hammanyaga Yusufu, akongaga kunda seuta ywa Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Awatendelaga want'hu wetu ukwank'walu, kuwadamanyila wiihi kuwatigiza wawaduule kuse wana wawe wakembe vileke wabanike. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Aho niho elekagwa Musa mwana mkembe mtana. Alelagwa kwawe kaya kwa miyezi mitatu, <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />eze aikigwe kuse ye kaya yawe, mwana kindele ywa Seuta ywa Misili amguhaga Musa no kumlela enga mwanawe. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Musa ahinizwagwa umanyi wose wa Wamisili, niyo akula kwa milosi na udamanyi.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />“Musa eze abule myaka milongo mine afanyanyaga kuwaona wanduguze Waizilaeli. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Aonaga Mzilaeli yumwenga akatoigwa nu Mmisili, niyo agenda kumwambiza no kumlihizila kwa kumkoma uyo Mmisili. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Agambaga mafa wanduguze Wazilaeli wadahaga kumanya kugamba Mnungu aunga awakombole kwa kombokela yehe Musa, mna hawakombaganyaga. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Zuwa ditimile awaonaga Wazilaeli waidi wakatoana, agezaga kuwalamula. ‘Tegelezeni, nyuwe want'hu, mwindugu wa hamwenga Wazilaeli, Mwatowanilanai?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Mna yudya yumwenga naakamtoesa miyawe niyo amsindikila kunk'handa Musa, akamgamba, ‘Niani akuikile kunda mkulu na mlamuzi ywetu?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />‘Waunga mnikome enga viya umkomile Mmisili gulo?’ ” <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Musa eze eve ivo, niyo anyilika Misili kuita Midiani. Uko elekaga wana wakilume waidi.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />“Ize yomboke myaka milongo mine, Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu amlailaga Musa mwo lulija lukwaka mwa kasaka, ukwo kwe dijangwa hagihi no mnima wa Sinai. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Musa ehelwagwa kwa ayo ayaonaga, niyo asogela hagihi hakasaka vileke akaule vedi. Mna niyo eva izwi dya Zumbe. <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Ni miye Mnungu ywa wakale wako, Mnungu ywa Ibulahimu, Mnungu ywa Isaka na Yakobo.’ Musa ogohaga na kuzingiza hagezile kukaula. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, ‘Hambula vilatu vako, aho ukimale ni hant'hu hakukile. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Hiuona ukwank'walu uwo wakutendelwa want'hu wangu ukwo Misili. Hiiva indilo yawe, hiseela kwiza kuwakombola. Nohutume uite Misili.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Musa niye yudya alemelwagwa ni Waizilaeli. Wamuuzaga. ‘Niani akugambile unde mkulu na kunda mlamuzi ywetu?’ Niyehe uyo atumigwe ni Mnungu kuwalongoza want'hu no kuwakombola kwa wambizi wa mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu, uyo amlailaga mwa kasaka kakukweela moto. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Awalongozaga mwo kufosa Misili, akadamanya vilagiso na kwehela ukwo Misili na kwe bahali ink'hudu, na kwe dijangwa kwa myaka milongo mine. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Musa niye awagambaga watu wa Izilaeli, ‘Mnungu na awasaguileni Mlotezi enga miye, kulawa mwa wandugu zenyu.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Niye yudya andaga hamwenga na want'hu wa Izilaeli wakeduganyaga kwe dijangwa, andaga uuko hamwenga na wakale wetu hamwenga no mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu alongaga naye kwo mnima wa Sinai, naho ahokelaga milosi yo ugima eze akigambile suwe.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />“Mna wakale wetu wamlemelaga kumwiva niyo wamsukumizila kunk'handa, no kunyemwa nyemwa kuuya Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Wamgambaga Haluni, ‘Kidamanyile mnungu akuunga akilongoze, kwaviya hakikumanya ayo yambwiile Musa, uyo akilavile Misili.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Wadamanyaga hili dikeigile njeku, wakaditendela nt'hambiko, wakavika kint'hu wakidamanye woho wenye. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Ivo Mnungu niyo awasa, na kuwaleka wavike nt'hondo zo ulanga, enga ivo viwandikwe mwe kitabu cha walotezi kugamba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Nyuwe want'hu wa Izilaeli! Hamwandile mwi wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">hiyo miye nomkanilavila nt'hambiko</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">kwa malavo milongo mine mwe dijangwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Nyuwe nomwinula heha dya Moleki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">ne kizuli cha Lefani, yumwenga mwe milungu nt'hondo yenyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">nayanda mahili mwayadamanyaga nt'hambiko.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Ivo elo neniwasamizeni mwite kujink'ha Babiloni.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />“Wakale wetu wandaga ne Dihema dya ulonga uwona uko kwedijangwa. Dyadamanyagwa enga viya mwenye Mnungu amsigiilaga Musa, kugamba didamanywe enga iviya Musa alagiswe. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Akajika naho, wakale wetu wadihokelaga diheha kulawa kwa watatizawe wandaga nadyo umwo wakanda na Yoshua, no kuzitaha ziisi kulawa kwe zink'holo zia Mnungu azigulusaga enga viya waziguhaga. Naho nedikala mpaka mwa mazuwa ya Daudi. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Daudi ahokelaga uwedi, niyo amlombeza Mnungu amwink'he hant'hu hakumzengela wikazi Mnungu ywa Yakobo. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Mna niyo Sulemani amzengela Mnungu nyumba.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />“Mna Mnungu ekulanga mwa yose hakwikala mwe zi nyumba zizengigwe ni mikono ya want'hu enga viya mlotezi akulonga,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />Zumbe agamba, ‘Mbingu nidyo difumbi dyangu dyo Useuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">isi niyo huikila iviga vangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Ni nyumba ya vivihi mkudaha kunizengela?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Heihi aho miye huunga nikale?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Vint'hu ivi voseni himiye nividamanye?’ ”<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Niyo Sitefano agendeela kulonga, “Nyuwe mna kigungu mtwi! Mioyo yenyu inda midala, magutwi yenyu hayakwiva ulosi wa Mnungu! Mnda enga wakale wenyu, nyuwe nanywe mwaungisa kumhiga Muye ywa Mnungu! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Togoleni eyuko mlotezi yeyose hesulumizwe ni wakale wenyu? Wawakomaga walotezi, awo walongaga ukwiza kwa yudya Mndima wo Uwedi. Naho haluse mumsezenga no kumkoma. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Ni nyuwe mwaihokelaga miko ya Mnungu idya yegalagwa ni mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu, mna mwiibela.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sitefano atoigwa maiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Umwo wadala we Kitala weze weve ivo Sitefano akulonga, wafaga maya niyo wagwegwejula meno kwa maya. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Mna Sitefano, amemigwe ni Muye ywa Mnungu, asinyaga kulanga no kuuona ukulu wa Mnungu, Yesu naye kakimala kulume kwa Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Niyo Sitefano agamba, “Kauleni nauona ulanga ukomoka, naho Mwana Mnt'hu kakimala kulume kwa Mnungu!”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Wadala we Kitala wagutilisaga, kwa mikono yawe wasitaga magutwi. Niyo wose kwa hamwenga wamkump'hukila, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />no kumduula kuse yo mzi niyo wamtowa maiwe. Wadya waone niyo waika suke zawe kwa ndugu ywetu akwitangwa Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Umwo wandile wakamtowa maiwe Sitefano, yehe amlombezaga Mnungu akagamba, “Zumbe Yesu, hokela umuye wangu!” <figure style="fig" file="19 Being Stoned.jpg" size="col" ref="7:59">Sitefano atoigwa maiwe</figure> <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Afikaga madi niyo aila kwa izwi kulu akagamba, “Zumbe! Use kukumbukila wavu wawe!” Alongaga ivo niyo abanika.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Naho Sauli alongaga uwona wo ukomi wakwe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Sauli awasulumiza wahuwila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Mwe dizuwa diya want'hu wamhuwile Kilisito mwe Yelusalemu wakongaga kukunt'hizwa kikwank'walu. Want'hu wose, kuleka wegala ulosi, wasambalaga uko Yuda na Samalia. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Want'hu wa Mnungu wamwenga wammosaga msanga Sitefano, no kumhongezela kwa ndilo nk'hulu.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Sauli agezaga kudisulumiza difyo dya wahuwila wa Kilisito. Awalavaga kuse ye zinyumba Zawe awo wahuwila, na kuwagela kwe divugailo.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli Yedi yabilikizwa mwe Samalia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Wadya wahuwila wasambalaga kose kudya wanyilikilaga wabilikizaga Mbuli Yedi. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filipo aitaga kwe mizi ya Samalia na kumbilikiza kugamba Yesu Kilisito niye Mkombozi. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Mafyo ya want'hu wandaga na nt'hegelezi mwa yadya naakalonga Filipo, kwaviya nawakamwiva, no kuwona vilagiso vingi adamanyaga. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Mp'hepo nezikawafosa want'hu kwa maizwi makulu ya ndilo, na wose wabindile ingi waholomp'hale ne viwete wose wahonyagwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Naivo kwandaga na kinyemi kikulu mwo mzi udya.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Kwandaga na mnt'hu yumwenga ekalaga aho, zina dyakwe etangagwa Simoni, awehelaga want'hu wo mzi wa Samalia kwa kudamanya usai wakwe. Naaka keduvya kugamba yehe andaga mnt'hu yumwenga mkulu, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />naho kila yumwenga mwo mzi uwo mwa malika yose, wamwogohesaga, wakagamba, “Yehe niye udahi wa mnungu amanyike enga ‘Udahi Mkulu’,” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Nawakamwogohesa kwaviya kwa lupisi lutali naaka wehela kwo usai wakwe. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Umwo weze wahuwile Filipo akabilikiza Mbuli Yedi yo Useuta wa Mnungu, na za Yesu Kilisito, wabatizagwa wose wogosi kwa wavele. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Simoni mwenye naye ahuwilaga, naho ize inde kabatizwa, ekalaga hagihi na Filipo naho ehelagwa umwo aonaga vakwehela vikulu na vihungi vandaga vikadamanywa.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Wegala Ulosi wa Yelusalemu wevaga kugamba want'hu wa Samalia wahokela mbuli ya Mnungu, ivo niyo wawegaila Petulo hamwenga na Yohana. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Weze wabule nawalombezelaga kwa Mnungu vileke wahokele Muye ywa Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Kwaviya Muye ywa Mnungu andaga akei kwiza kwa yeyose mwawe, nawabatizwa du kwe dizina dya Zumbe Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Niho Petulo na Yohana wawageleka mikono mwawe, niyo wahokela Muye ywa Mnungu.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Simoni aonaga kugamba wahuwila wahokela Muye ywa Mnungu aho wegala ulosi weze wawageleke mikono. Ivo aungaga kuwenk'ha matundu Petulo na Yahana, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />no kuwagamba, “Nink'heni udahi uno name vileke inde kila huunga nimgeleke mikono ahokele Muye ywa Mnungu.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Mna Petulo niyo amhitula kugamba, “Weye na matundu yako kagiileni hale, kwaviya weye wagamba udahi wa Mnungu waguligwa kwa matundu. <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Huna hant'hu, hegu kuhangila mwe ndima yetu kwaviya moyo wako hauwagilwe mwa meso ya Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Kwaivo mhitukile Zumbe vileke zifanyanyi zako ziihile, naho mnombeze vileke akuusile weye zifanyanyi enga izi. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Naona kugamba kumemwa ni finyu naho umvugailwa wa wavu.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simoni niyo awagamba Petulo na Yohana, “Nilombezeleni kwa Zumbe, disekunilaila dyodyose mwa aya mkulonga.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Petulo na Yohana weze wajike kulava uwona no kugendeza kose ulosi wa Zumbe, niyo wauya Yelusalemu. Umwo mwe sila wabilikizaga Mbuli Yedi ya Mnungu mwe zikaya zibindile ingi za Samalia.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filipo ambatiza mkulu yumwenga ywa Isiopia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Mtumigwa ywa Zumbe amgambaga Filipo, “Keike lumwe wiite kwa mwenye mzi, kwe sila ikulawa Yelusalemu kuita Gaza.” Sila ino haikugendwa mazuwa aya. <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Filipo akeikaga lumwe niyo aita. Mnt'hu yumwenga ywa Isiopia andaga mgosi afunt'higwe, naho andaga mnt'hu mkulu amanyike, mkulu ywe kindolo chose cha Kandake, seuta ywe kivele ywa Isiopia. Andaga uko Yelusalemu akamvika Mnungu, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />andaga akauya kaya Mwe ditololi dyakwe. Umwo andaga akadigendeza, andaga kagubula kitabu cha mlotezi Isaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Muye ywa Mnungu niyo amgamba Filipo, “Ita hagihi ne diya ditololi, unde hagihi nadyo.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Filipo adigulukilaga niyo amwiva yudya mnt'hu akasoma kulawa mwe kitabu cho mlotezi Isaya. Filipo amuuzaga, “Togola wakombaganya icho ukusoma?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Mkulu niyo ahitula, “Nenikombaganye vivihi haheina mnt'hu ywa kunitambalisa?” Ivo elo amgambaga Filipo akwele mwe ditololi no kwikala hamwenga naye. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Ayo mawandiko Yakukile ayo andagaakasoma uyo mnt'hu yandaga ivi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">“Enga viya ngoto ikwigalwa kwo kuchinjwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">enga viya mwanangoto heekuila akapuchulwa mazoya yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">halongile dyodyose.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Nakagelekwa uhuza, na kuswesa uwagilwa kwakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Niani akudaha kusimuila, mbuli ze cheleko chakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">kwaviya wikazi wakwe mwe isi ubula kwo uheelo.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Yudya mkulu niyo amgamba Filipo, “Hake nigambile, niyuhi akulongwa nu mlotezi uyu? Akelonga mwenye, hegu eyuko mtuhu?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Filipo akongaga kulonga, akakongela nk'hongo yo ulosi wa mawandiko Yakukile, akamgambila Mbuli Yedi ya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Umwo wandile wakagenda hasi mwe sila, wabulaga hant'hu hana mazi, niyo mkulu yudya agamba, “Aha hana mazi, nafingizwa nii nisekubatizwa?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filipo niyo amgamba, “Wadaha kubatizwa uneva wahuwila kwo umoyo wako wose.” Yudya mnt'hu niyo ahitula, “Nahuwila, nahuwila kugamba Yesu Kilisito niye Mwana Mnungu.”<verse eid="ACT 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Yudya mkulu niyo asigiila ditololi dikimale, niyo Filipo hamwenga na yudya mkulu waseela hasi mwa mazi, niyo Filipo ambatiza. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Umwo weze wafose mwa mazi, Muye ywa Mnungu niyo amguha Filipo, niyo ahalawa ha meso ya yudya mkulu. Yudya mkulu hamuwone naho, mna nakagendeela no utafi wakwe amemigwe ni kinyemi. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Filipo naketukila kabula uko Azoto, niyo agendeela no utafi mpaka Kaisalia, mwe sila abilikizaga Mbuli Yedi ya Mnungu mwe kila mzi.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Sauli ahituka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Mna Sauli agendeelaga kutisa na kufanyanya kuwakoma wanamp'hina wa Zumbe. Aitaga kwa Mlava nt'hambiko Mkulu <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />niyo alombeza baluwa zikumwink'ha udahi wa kuita kwe zinyumba zo kuvika uko Damesiki, vileke anawabwiila want'hu we sila iyo ya Zumbe wagosi na wavele, awagwile no kuwegala Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Sauli eze abule hagihi no mzi wa Damesiki, aaho ung'azi kulawa kulanga wa mmwekelaga nt'hendelo zose. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Agwaga hasi niyo eva izwi dikumwitanga, “Sauli! Sauli! Nii wanigela manisulumiza?” <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Sauli niyo auza, “Weye niwe ani, Zumbe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Izwi niyo dya hitula, “Ni miye Yesu, ukunigela makunt'ho.” <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />“Mna kimala wingile mwo mzi, ukwo noukagambilwe yo kudamanya.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Wadya want'hu wandaga hamwenga na Sauli, wakimalaga heweeina dya kulonga, wadiivaga idizwi mna hawaonaga mnt'hu yeyose. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Sauli akimaalaga na kufinyula meso yakwe, mna haonaga chochose. Ivo niyo wamtoza mkono no kumlongoza kwo mzi wa Damesiki. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Kwa mazuwa matatu hadahaga kukaula, aho hose andaga hakudya naho hakunywa chochose.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Kwandaga na mwanamp'hina yumwenga mwo mzi wa Damesiki etangagwa Anania. Enk'hagwa uwona ni Mnungu akamgamba, “Anania!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Anania niyo etika, “Woe, Zumbe”<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Zumbe niyo amgamba, “Keike lumwe uite kwe sila ichumile, kwe nyumba ya Yuda, ukauze mnt'hu alaile Taso zina dyakwe Sauli. Alombeza Mnungu <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />naho mwo uwona wakwe, kaona mnt'hu akwitangwa Anania akengila no kumgeleka mikono vileke adahe kuwona kaidi.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Anania niyo amhitula, “Zumbe, want'hu wengi wanigambila zimbuli zo mnt'hu uyo, no makunt'ho yose awatendele want'hu wako uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Naho ivo keza Damesiki akanda na udahi kwa kutumigwa ni wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko, awagwile wose wakukuvika weye.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Zumbe niyo amhitula Anania, “Ita, kwaviya himsagula kunda mndima ywangu, kuditenda zina dyangu dimanyike kwa wadya hi Wayahudi, na kwa mazumbe, na kwa want'hu wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Naho miye mwenye nenimlagise yose akuunga asulumizwe kwe dizina dyangu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Ivo Anania aitaga no kwingila mwe nyumba idya andaga umwo Sauli, nokumgeleka mikono. Anania niyo amgamba Sauli, “Ndugu yangu Sauli, Zumbe Yesu yudya akulaile mwe sila umwo wandile ukeza aha, kanituma vileke wink'we kuwona vituhu, naho uhokele Muye ywa Mnungu.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Aho vint'hu vikwinga makobembe ya samaki yatomokaga kulawa mwa meso ya Sauli, niyo adaha kukaula naho. Akimaalaga niyo abatizwa, <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />eze adye nk'hande niyo nguvu zamuuiya naho.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Sauli abilikiza uko Damesiki</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Sauli ekalaga kwa mazuwa mageke na wanamp'hina aho Damesiki. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Aitaga luholuho kwe nyumba yo kuvikila no kukonga kubilikiza kugamba Yesu, mwana Mnungu.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Wose wamwivaga Sauli wehelagwa na kuuza, “Uyu hiye yudya andaga akawakoma wose nawakamvika Yesu kudya Yelusalemu? Naho hezile aha mwe mbuli yo kuwagwila want'hu no kuwegala kwa wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko?”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Mna mabilikizo ya Sauli yagendeelaga kunda na udahi mkulu, no ulavanyi wakwe kugamba Yesu niye Kilisito Mkombozi asagulwe ni Mnungu, nouwatenda Wayahudi wandaga wakekala Damesiki wase kudaha kuuza dyodyose.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Mazuwa mengi yeze yande yagendeela, Wayahudi wekalaga hamwenga wakaika mzungu wo kumkoma Sauli, <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />mna Sauli nakagambilwa mizungu yawe. Kilo na msi nawakamongola mwe mizi vileke wamkome. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Mna kilo kimwenga, wanamp'hina awo wandaga na Sauli wamguhaga mwe digahu dinyinyigwe luzigi niyo wamlava kwa kumseleza mwe dilanga dyo lukazi lwa zungulukaga muzi.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli uko Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Sauli aitaga Yelusalemu niyo ageza kukelunga na wanamp'hina mna hawamzumilaga kugamba andaga mwanamp'hina kindedi, naho wose wandaga wakamogoha. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Banaba ezaga kumguhuha na kumwambiza kumwigala kwa wanamp'hina. Awatambalisaga vedi ivo Sauli amuone Zumbe na ivo walonganye. Awagambilaga iviya iviya ivo Sauli naakabilikiza uko Damesiki kwa kwe duvila dizina dya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Sauli ekalaga nawo naho waitanyaga Yelusalemu wakabilikiza kwa weduvi mwe dizina dya Zumbe. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Naho atalaulaga na Wayahudi wakulonga Kigiliki mna hawamzumile, naho wagezaga kumkoma. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Wandugu wahuwila weze wabunk'hule ivo, wamwigalaga Sauli kwo mzi wa Kaisalia, no kumtuma aite Taso.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Naivo aho niyo idifyo dya want'hu wamhuwile Kilisito dyekala mp'heho tondolo, mose mwe Yuda na Galilaya na Samalia. Kwa wambizi wa Muye ywa Mnungu, want'hu wa Mnungu nawenk'higwa udahi naho na wagenyela wakalongozwa ni Zumbe.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo uko Luda na Jopa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Petulo andaga akagenda kila hant'hu. Zuwa dimwenga agendaga kuwatalamkila want'hu wa Mnungu wandaga wakekala Luda. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Kudya abwiilaga mnt'hu yumwenga etangagwa Ainea, andaga kaholomp'hala, naho hadahaga kwinuka mwo lusazi kwa miyaka mnane. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Petulo niyo amgamba, “Ainea, Yesu Kilisito akuhonya. Kimala udamanye lusazi lwako.” Aaho niyo Ainea akimaala. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Want'hu wose nawakekala Luda na Shaloni nawamuona Ainea, niyo wose wamhitukila Zumbe.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Kwandaga na mvele yumwenga uko Yopa etangagwa Tabisa, andaga mhuwila. Zina dyakwe kwe Kigiliki etangwa Dokasi, nuko kugamba kapala yehe ni mdamanya yedi mazuwa yose, na kuwambiza wakiwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Ahumaga niyo abanika, umwili wakwe wahakagwa mazi no kulambalikwa mwe chumba cha halanga. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Yopa hakwandaga hale vitendese kulawa Luda, naho wanamp'hina wezeweve kugamba Petulo eyuko Lida, wawatumaga want'hu waidi wenk'higwe baluwa ikugamba, “Usunguze kwiza kwetu.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Ivo Petulo akeikaga lumwe niyo waitanya. Eze abule wamwigalaga kwe chumba cha halanga, uko wose wabanikilwe niwagosi zawe wamzungulukaga Petulo wakaila, no kumlagisa zisuke zia Dokasi adamanyaga umwo andaga mgima. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Petulo awalavaga kuse ye chumba want'hu wose, niyo afika madi no kumlombeza Mnungu, Niyo amhitukila yudya abanike no kumgamba, “Tabisa, inukila!” Niyo agubula meso yakwe, eze amuone Petulo niyo atakwikala. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Petulo amtozaga mkono no kumwambiza kukimala, niyo awetanga wadya wahuwila wa Yesu wose hamwenga na wadya wafilwe ni wagosi zawe, niyo awenk'ha uyo Tabisa akanda mgima. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Mbuli ino niyo ya gendezwa mwe Yopa yose, naho want'hu wengi niyo wamhuwila Zumbe. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Petulo ekalaga mazuwa mengi aho Yopa hamwenga na Simoni mdamanya nk'hingo.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Petulo adugana na Kolinelio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Kwandaga na mnt'hu mwe Kaisalia etangagwa Kolinelio, andaga mkulu wa fyo dya wank'hondo wa Kilumi dyetangagwa, “Fyo dya Kiitalia”. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Andaga mnt'hu ywa Mnungu, yehe ne mp'huga yakwe mwe nyumba wandaga ni want'hu wakumvika Mnungu. Iviya iviya adamanyaga yabindile ingi yakuwambiza wakiwa, naho naakamvika Mnungu mazuwa yose. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Yandaga saa kenda kisingi umwo aonaga maona ayo. Mwa maona yao amuonaga mtumigwa ywa Mnungu akamwizila kwe nyumba no kumgamba, “Kolinelio!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Niyo amkaulisa kwa kogoha, niyo amgamba, “Kuna mbwai Zumbe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Yudya mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu niyo amhitula, “Mnungu kelelwa na malavo yako hamwenga ne ndima yako yo ukise naho haakujale, kakeika lumwe kukuhitula. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Haluse tuma want'hu waite Yopa, kwa mnt'hu yumwenga akwitangwa Simoni Petulo. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Yehe ni mgeni mwe nyumba ya mnt'hu yumwenga mdamanya nk'hingo akwitagwa Simoni, akwikala hagihi ne bahali.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Yudya mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu niyo akeitila, Kolinelio etangaga watumwa wakwe waidi, naho mnk'hondo ywakwe yumwenga andaga mnt'hu amwelele Mnungu mwa wandima wakwe. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Awagambilaga yose yalaile niyo awatuma kuita Yopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulagiso wa Petulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Zuwa ditimile umwo wandaga wakaita, weze wande hagihi na Yopa, umwo yandaga msi wa gati, Petulo akwelaga kulanga kwe nyumba vileke akamlombeze Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Akeivaga sala niyo aunga kint'hu cha kudya, umwo nk'hande yandaga ikaikwa lumwe aonaga maona. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Aonaga ulanga ukagubuka, no kuwona kint'hu kikaseela hasi kikale enga golole kulu dikuselezwa ditozigwe zimp'hembe zakwe izine. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Umwo, mwandaga na nk'holo zose za makala na magondo na madege. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Evaga Izwi dikamgamba, “Petulo, kimala guha uchinje udye!”<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Mna Petulo niyo agamba, “Havikudahika Zumbe. Hyanda nidye chochose kisavu.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Izwi niyo dyalonga naye naho, “Use kukifanyanya kunda kisavu chochose kitendigwe ni Mnungu kunda kikukile.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Ino yalailaga nk'hanana nt'hatu. Ize yajike niyo kint'hu kiya chavuzwa kulanga.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Umwo Petulo andaga akafanyanya amaona ya nivo yagaaze, wadya want'hu watumigwe kulawa kwa Kolinelio weze waimanye inyumba ya Simoni, na wakimala kulongole kwe nk'hili. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Wetangaga wakauza, “Hana mnt'hu mgeni aha akwitangwa Simoni Petulo?”<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Petulo andaga akagendeela kufanyanya kugamba maona yadya nivo yagaaze, Muye ywa Mnungu amgambaga, “Tegeleza! Want'hu watatu wakuzungula. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Ivo keike lumwe useele hasi, naho usekunda na nk'hangamizi kunda nawo kwaviya ni miye niwatumile.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Ivo Petulo aseelaga hasi niyo awagamba wadya want'hu. “Nimiye mnt'hu yudya mkumzungula. Haya hunguleni?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Niyo wahitula, “Mkulu ywa wank'hondo Kolinelio kakituma, yehe ni mnt'hu ywedi akumvika Mnungu naho Wayahudi wose wamhuwilisa. Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu kamgamba akulalike kwakwe, akutegeleze kiya ukulonga.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Petulo kawahokela want'hu awo kwe nyumba no kuwenk'ha hant'hu ha kugona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Zuwa ditimile Petulo nakakeika lumwe niyo aitanya nawo naho wandugu wamwenga kulawa Yopa walongolaga hamwenga naye. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Zuwa ditimile abulaga Kaisalia, uko Kolinelio naakamgoja hamwenga na wanduguze na wambuya wa hagihi naye, wadya awalalike. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Umwo Petulo andaga akengila kwe nyumba, Kolinelio amsingilaga, niyo amgweela heviga vakwe, no kumwinamila hasi hakwe. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Mna Petulo niyo amwinula akamgamba, “Kimala, miye name ni mnt'hu du enga weye.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Petulo agendeelaga kulonga na Kolonelio umwo andile akengila kwe nyumba, uko abwiilaga want'hu wengi wadugane. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Awagambaga want'hu awo, “Nyuwe mmanya vedi kugamba Wayahudi hawawagilwe, kwe dini yawe kuwatalamkila hegu kukehanganya na want'hu hi Wayahudi, mna Mnungu kanilagisa miye kugamba, hikuungwa kumfanyanya mnt'hu yeyose kugamba msavu. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Ivo mwize mnitumile want'hu nehiza ha heina nk'hangamizi yoyose. Nawauzani elo mnitumilai want'hu?”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Kolinelio niyo ahitula, “Neinda saivi haluse, mazuwa matatu yomboke kugamba nandaga halombeza Mnungu kwe nyumba yangu saa kenda kisingi, Luholuho nakimailagwa kulongole kwangu ni mnt'hu availe suke zikumweka <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />niyo anigamba, ‘Kolinelio! Mnungu keva kulombeza kwako naivo hajaile zindima zako zo ukise. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Tuma mnt'hu aite Yopa kwe mnt'hu yumwenga akwitangwa Simoni Petulo, Yehe ni mgeni mwe nyumba ya Simoni mdamanya nk'hingo, akwikala hagihi ne bahali.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Naivo niyo zasunguza kukutumila mnt'hu, naho nevinda vedi kwa weye kwiza. Haluse wose kiaya mwo undiilo wa Mnungu, kikageza kwiva chochose Zumbe akuunga akusigiile kulonga.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa Petulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Petulo akongaga kulonga akagamba, “Haluse namanya ni kindedi kugamba Mnungu awatendela want'hu wose yakuligana. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Wadya wose wakumvika no kudamanya ayedi naawazumile hata uneva walawa kokose. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Muumanya ulosi awegaile want'hu wa Izilaeli, udya ukulonga Mbuli yedi ya Mnungu yo utondowazi kombokela kwa Yesu Kilisito uyo Zumbe ywa want'hu wose. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Mmanya yalaile mwe isi ye Wayahudi kukongela mwe Galilaya aho Yohana eze abilikize ulosi wo ubatizo. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Mummanya Yesu wa Nazaleti na ivo Mnungu ammemeze Muye ywakwe no udahi. Aitaga kila hant'hu akadamanya mbuli zedi no kuwahonya wose wekailwe ni ludole lwo mwavu, kwaviya andaga na Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Nisuwe kione no kulonga kila kint'hu kiya adamanye mwe isi yo Uyahudi na mwe Yelusalemu. Naho wamkomaga kwa kumuwamba mwo msalaba. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Mna Mnungu amuuyulaga mwe dizuwa dya katatu no kumtenda akelavilize, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />hiyo kwa kila mnt'hu, ila kwa wadya waona wakwe wasagulwe lumwe ni Mnungu, nao ni suwe kidile na kunywa hamwenga na yehe aho eze auyuke. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Nakakisigiila kubilikiza Mbuli Yedi kwa want'hu, no kuwawenk'ha kindedi kugamba Yesu niye asagulwe ni Mnungu kuwasengela wagima na wabanike. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Walotezi wose nawalonga mwa yehe kugamba, wose wakuunga wanande, na mhuwi mwa yehe, wavu wawe nouusigwe kwo udahi we dizina dyakwe.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu hi Wayahudi wahokela Muye ywa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Umwo Petulo andile akagendeela kulonga, Muye ywa Mnungu aseelaga mwa wose wadya nawakamtegeleza mwo ulosi wakwe. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Wahuwila we Kiyahudi wezaga hamwenga na Petulo kulawa Yopa, weehelwagwa digeleko dya Muye ywa Mnungu hata kwa wadya hi Wayahudi wose. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Kwaviya nawaweva wakalonga kwe milosi mihya, na kuutogola ukulu wa Mnungu. Petulo niyo agamba. <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Want'hu awa wahokela Muye ywa Mnungu, enga viya suwe chahokelaga. Mnt'hu yeyose hakudaha kuwa kindila wase kubatizwa na mazi?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Ivo niyo alagiza wabatizwe kwe dizina dya Yesu Kilisito. Niyo wamlombeza Petulo ekale nawo kwa mazuwa mageke.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Simulizi ya Petulo kwa wahuwila wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Wegala Ulosi na wandugu wahuwila watuhu mwo Uyahudi yose wevaga kugamba want'hu hi Wayahudi nawo wahokela Mbuli ya Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Umwo Petulo aitaga Yelusalemu, wadya wose wandile no mhuwi mwo kuvinilwa, nawaka mkalaliza wakamgamba. <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />“Nokunda mgeni mwa want'hu hewevinilwe naho kudya hamwenga nowo!” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Petulo niyo awagambila ikindedi ivo mbuli iyo ilaile kukongela nk'hongo.<verse eid="ACT 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Umwo nandile halombeza Mnungu mwo mzi wa Yopa, naonaga maona. Naonaga kint'hu chaseelaga kulawa kulanga, chandaga, enga mgolole mkulu ukakuselezwa utozigwe mwe zimp'hembe zakwe zine, niyo dyeza halongole kwa hadya miye nandile. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Nadisinyaga kwa hagihi mndani mwakwe, naonaga mifugwa na makala mbago, magondo, na madege mbago. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Niyo neva Izwi dikunigamba. ‘Petulo inuka uchinje udye!’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Mna nahitulaga kugamba, ‘Havikudahika, Zumbe! Mnomo wangu haunati wingile ni kint'hu kisavu na zuwa dimwe.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Izwi dyalongaga na miye kaidi, ‘Use kukigamba kisavu, kiya Mnungu akitendile kunda kikukile.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Mbuli ino ilaila nk'hanana nt'hatu, akajika niyo yavuzwa kwe mbingu. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Ahadya want'hu watatu watumagwa kwangu kulawa Kaisalia, wabulaga he nyumba hadya nandaga. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Muye ywa Mnungu anigambaga niite nawo haheina nk'angamizi, Wandugu wahuwila awa mtandatu kulawa Yopa wanisindikizaga kuita Kaisalia, niyo chose chaita kwe nyumba ya Kolinelio. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Nakakigambila ivo amuone mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu akimale he nyumba yakwe amgambile, ‘Tuma mnt'hu aite Yopa kwa mnt'hu akwitangwa Simoni Petulo. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Naalonge mbuli kwako, mwe imbuli Yedi iyo weye ne nyumba yako yose nomyokolwe.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Naho nize nikonge kulonga, Muye ywa Mnungu aweziilaga kulawa kulanga enga viya vandaga kwetu suwe kudya nk'hongo. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Niho nakumbukile kiya alongaga Zumbe, ‘Yohana abatizaga kwa mazi, mna nyuwe nombatizwe kwa Muye ywa Mnungu.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Naho imanyika kugamba Mnungu kawenk'ha wose hi wayahudi, digeleko diya akink'haga suwe umwo chamhuwilaga Zumbe Yesu Kilisito Mkombozi, Miye ni miye ani inde nimhige Mnungu!”<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Weze weve ivo niyo waleka kulonga ila kumtogola Mnungu wakagamba, “Mnungu kawenk'ha want'hu hi Wayahudi nawo vileke wakweiile no kwingila kwo ugima!”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wahuwila wa Yesu Kilisito ukwo Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Wahuwila wamwenga wadya wasambalaga kwa masulumizo yalailaga umwo Sitefano akomagwa, waitaga hale Foeniki na Kipulo na Antiokia wakabilikiza mwa Wayahudi aawo du. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Mna wahuwila watuhu waitaga Antiokia, wakombokela Kipulo na Kilene wakabilikiza kwa Wayahudi we Kigiliki, Mbuli Yedi ya Zumbe Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Udahi wa Zumbe nounda hamwenga nawo, fyo kulu dya want'hu dyahuwilaga no kumhitukila Zumbe.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Ulosi uwo wawabwiilaga want'hu wamhuwile Kilisito wa uko Yelusalemu, ivo niyo wamtuma Banaba aite Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Umwo eze abule no kuwona Mnungu ivo awenk'hile want'hu uwedi wakwe, nakelelwa no kuwagela moyo wande no mhuwi we kindedi kwa Zumbe mwe mioyo yawe. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Banaba andaga mnt'hu ywedi amemile Muye ywa Mnungu no mhuwi, naho want'hu wengi wegalagwa kwa Zumbe.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Banaba niyo aita Taso akamkaule Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Eze amuone amguhaga niyo waitanya Antiokia, naho mwo mwaka mgima waidi awa wadugana na fyo dya wahuwila wa Kilisito wakahiniza fyo kulu dya want'hu. Ni kudya Antiokia aho wanamp'hina wakongaga kwitangwa Wakilisito.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Mwo lupisi ulo walotezi wamwenga waitaga Antiokia wakalawa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Yumwenga mwa woho etangagwa Agabo, akimalaga kwa udahi wa Muye ywa Mnungu akalotela kugamba gumbo kulu nedingile mwe isi. Gumbo idyo dyalailaga umwo Kilaudia andaga Zumbe. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Wanamp'hina wa Kilisito wafanyanyaga kugamba nawakadaha kila yumwenga mo udahi wakwe, kuwambiza wandugu zawe wahuwila nawekekala Uyahudi. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Wadamanyaga ivo no kwigala matundu kwe wadala vilongozi we idifyo dya wahuwila wa Kilisito kwa kombokela kwa Banaba no miyawe Sauli.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Makunt'ho ye Wagela Ulosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Aha niho Zumbe Helode akongaga kuwakunt'hiza want'hu we difyo dya wahuwila wa Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Mkuluwe dya Yohana uyo naaketangwa Yakobo, akomigwa kwa kukant'higwa mtwi kwa bamba. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Eze aone diya diwelela Wayahudi agendeelaga kwa kumgwila Petulo. Ino yalailaga aho kwandaga na zuwa dya kinyemi dya mikate heigeligwe ugwadu. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Petulo eze agwilwe niyo ageligwa kwe divugailo, uko naakamilwa ni vibunga vine vina wamizi wane kila kabunga kamwenga, Helode akawiilaga kumlavila he kiyeti cha want'hu umwo Pasaka ikajika. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Ivo Petulo Avugailwagwa kwedivugailo mna want'hu wamhuwile Kilisito, wamlombezela Mnungu kwajili yakwe.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo alekelwa kulawa kwedivugailo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Nekilo Helode akei kugenda kumlava Petulo kwe kitala kwa want'hu, Petulo agonaga hagatigati ha wank'hondo waidi wandaga wakamdima, akakilizagwa mp'hingu mbili umwenga kulume na mtuhu kumoso, naho kwenk'hili kwandaga na wamizi. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Aaho mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu ywa Zumbe akimalaga hadya no kugela ung'azi mwe chumba chose. Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu amsingisaga Petulo mwediyega, akamgamba, “sunguza kwinuka!” Aho idya mp'hingu niyo yatomoka kulawa mwe mikono ya Peulo. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Yudya mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu niyo amgamba Petulo, “Sunguza, vala vilatu vako no mkoa wako.” Petulo atendaga ivo mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu amgambilaga, Naho niyo mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu ywa Mnungu amgamba Petulo, “Vala suke yako unitimile.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Petulo niyo amtimila kuse ye divugailo, hamanyize dyodyose, uneva ayo naakayadamanya uyo mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu uneva nayanda ya kindedi, Petulo naakagamba yadya akuona ni maona. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Wombokaga ho mwamizi ywa nk'hongo, na ywa kaidi, niyo weza kubindiliza kwe nk'hili ye chuma ikuhinga kwo mzi, nk'hili yakomokaga yoho yenye, niyo wafosa kuse. Wandaga wakagenda mwe sila imwenga aaho yudya mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu niyo amleka Petulo.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Niyo Petulo akombaganya kiya kilaile no kugamba, “Haluse namanya kugamba iki ni kindedi kugamba Zumbe kanitumila mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu kunikombola kulawa kwo udahi wa Helode no kulawa kwe kila kint'hu kikauilwe ni Wayahudi kulaila.” <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Petulo eze amanye ivo vili, aita kwe kaya ya Maliamu, nine dya Yohana Maliko, uko want'hu wengi wandaga wakadugana wakalombeza Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Petulo atoaga hodi, niyo mwambizi etangagwa Loda ezaga kumkomoela. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Nakadikombaganya diizwi dya Petulo, niyo engilwa ni kinyemi mwo moyo, vilekile agulukaga kuuya kunyuma kwe nyumba haheina kukomola umnango no kuwagambila kugamba Petulo andaga kakimala kuse. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Niyo wamgamba, “Weye umkilalu!” Mna niyo akombeka kulonga kugamba ni kindedi. Ivo niyo wahitula, “Yadahika ni mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu.”<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Mna Petulo nakagendeela kutoa hodi, niyo wamkomoela umnango, naho weze wamuwone Petulo naweehelwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Niyo awahunga mkono vileke wanyamale, naho niyo awagambila ivo Zumbe amfoseze kulawa kwe divugailo akagamba, “Mgambileni Yakobo na wandugu wahuwila watuhu,” niyo ahalawa no kuita kunt'hu kutuhu.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Kwize kuche niyo kwanda na nk'humbizi mwa wamizi kugamba Petulo kaitahi? <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Helode asigiilaga kumzungula Petulo, mna hawadahile kumuwona. Awetangaga awo wamizi no kuwauza mbuli, niyo asigiila wamizi awo wakomigwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Yeze yomboke ayo, Helode alawaga Uyahudi no kugenda kwikala mwe isi ya Kaisalia.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">File ya Helode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Helode awaihiyaga want'hu wa Sidoni na Tilo. Want'hu awo we mizi iyo miidi, wakeduganyaga hamwenga wakamuone. Nk'hongo wamluvyaga Bulasito vileke ande kwawe, uyo mnyamp'hala mkulu ywe nyumba yo uzumbe no kumlombeza wekale kwa utondowazi kwaviya isi zawe nezink'higwa nk'hande kulawa kwe isi ze kiseuta.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Mwe dizuwa disagulwe, Helode avalaga suke zakwe ze kiseuta no kwikala mwe difumbi dyo useuta, niyo akonga kuwabilikiza want'hu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Niyo wanga wakagamba, “Idi hidyo izwi dya mnt'hu, ni izwi dya yumwenga ywe milungu!” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Aaho mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu amkubilaga Helode mpaka hasi, kwaviya Helode alemelaga kumwink'ha ukulu Mnungu ivo niyo adigwa mimango niyo kubanika.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Mna mbuli ya Mnungu yagendeelaga na kwenela na kukula.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Banaba na Sauli wabindaga ubilikizi wawe, na kuuya Yelusalemu wakanda hamwenga na Yohana etangagwa Maliko.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Banaba na Sauli wasagulwa no kwigalwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Wamwenga mwe difyo dya wahuwila wa Kilisito dya Antiokia, wandaga walotezi, watuhu nao wandaga wahinizi. Banaba na Simioni etangagwa Mtitu, hamwenga na Lukia kulawa Kilene na Sauli, na Manaeni alelagwa ni Helode. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Umwo wandaga wakamvika Zumbe no kufunga, Muye ywa Mnungu awagambaga, “Nipaguileni hank'handa Banaba na Sauli, wadamanye ndima idya niwetangile.”<verse eid="ACT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Wafungaga na kumlombeza Mnungu no kuwageleka mikono, no kuwatuma awo Banaba na Sauli waite Kipulo.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wegala ulosi wabilikiza uko Kipulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Weze wegalwe ni Muye ywa Mnungu, Sauli na miyawe Banaba waitaga Seleukia watambaga mwe bahali mpaka mwe visiwa va Kipulo. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Weze wabule kudya Salami, wabilikizaga Mbuli ya Mnungu mwe zinyumba zo kuvikila za Kiyahudi. Wandaga hamwenga na Yohana mndima ywawe, akawambiza indima.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Umwo wandaga wakajink'hanya kisiwa kuita Pafo, kudya waduganaga na mnt'hu yumwenga msai etangagwa Bali Yesu, Myahudi agambagwa kunda mlotezi. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Andaga hamwenga na mbwiyaye ywo mkulu we kisiwa etangagwa Segio Paulo, andaga no udahi wo ukombaganyi. Uyo mkulu awetangaga Sauli na Banaba kwaviya aungaga ategeleze mbuli ya Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Mna msai yumwenga etangagwa Elima kwaviya idyo ni zina dyakwe mwe Kigiliki, awahigaga kwa kugeza kuvuza kunyuma uhuwila wo mkulu yudya. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Sauli uyo Paulo umwo andaga amemile Muye ywa Mnungu amng'oelaga meso yudya msai <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />niyo amgamba, “Weye mwana wo Mwavu! Weye ywi mnk'hondo ywa kila kint'hu kikuzumilwa kunda chedi, kumema upapala wi hengi wiihile naho mazuwa yose wageza kuhitula sila zichumile za Zumbe kunda udant'hi! <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Mkono wa Zumbe noukutoe ivi haluse, nounde nt'hunt'hu naho houone ung'azi wo umsi kwa lupisi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Aaho Elima aonaga lwiza lukagubika ameso yakwe, niyo akonga kutunt'husa akazungula mnt'hu wa amlongoze kwa kumtoza mkono. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Yudya mkulu eze aone kiya kilaile, ahuwilaga, kwaviya eheelagwa kwa mahinizo ya Zumbe.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Banaba wabula Antiokia na Pisidia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Paulo na weyawe watambaga ne ngalawa kulawa Pafo no mpaka Pega, mzi wa Pamfilia, kudya Yohana uyo Maliko awasaga woho no kuuya Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Wagendeelaga kulawa Pega no mpaka Antiokia mo mzi wa Pisidia. Mwe dizuwa dyo kuhumula wengilaga mwe nyumba yo kuvikila ya Wayahudi niyo wekala hasi. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Weze wajike kusoma mwe kitabu che miko ya Musa na mwa Mawandiko Yakukile ya walotezi, mkulu we nyumba ya kuvika Mnungu niyo awegaila ulosi akawagamba, “Wandugu zangu, chaunga mlonge na want'hu uneva mna ulosi wowose wa kuwagela moyo.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Paulo akimaalaga, akawahunga no mkono niyo agamba,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">“Wambuya zangu Wazilaeli na want'hu wose aha mkumvika Mnungu, mnitegeleze! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Mnungu wa want'hu wa Wazilaeli, awasagulaga wakale wetu niyo awatenda want'hu kunda taifa kulu umwo wandaga wageni mwe si ya Misili, Mnungu awaguhaga kulawa Misili kwa udahi mkulu, <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />naho kwa myaka milongo mine, kafinyiliza mwa woho uko kwe dijangwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Ayakomaga makabila mfungate, mwe isi ya Kanani no kuwenk'ha want'hu wakwe isi idya inde yawe. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Yano yose yaguhaga myaka magana mane na milongo mishano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">“Yeze yajike aya, awenk'haga walamuzi, mpaka mpaka mwa Mlotezi Samweli. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Naho weze walombeze kwinkwa Zumbe, Mnungu awegailaga Sauli, mwana Kishi, kabila dya Benjamini kunda seuta ywawe kwa myaka milongo mine. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Eze ausigwe, Mnungu amwikaga Daudi kunda Zumbe ywawe, naivi nivo Mnungu alongaga mwa yehe kugamba, ‘Hiyo na kugamba Daudi mwana Yese ni mnt'hu mwa wadya huunga, ni mnt'hu akudamanya yose yadya huunga yehe adamanye.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Andaga ni Yesu mwana Daudi atendigwe ni Mnungu kunda Mlokozi ywa Wazilaeli, enga viya amwink'hile ndagano. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Umwo Yesu andaga akei kukonga indima yakwe, Yohana mbatizi awabilikizaga want'hu wose wa Izilaeli waleke wavu wawe no kubatizwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Yohana eze ande abindiliza indima yo ubilikizi, niyo awagamba want'hu, ‘Mwagamba ni miye Mkombozi? Miye hiye yudya mkumgoja, mna tegelezeni! Eza kunyuma yangu, naho hiwagiliswe kuhambula vilatu vakwe kulawa mwe viga vakwe.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Wandugu zangu Wazilaeli, cheleko cha Ibulahimu, na want'hu watuhu wose aha wakumvika Mnungu, ulosi uno wo kukombolwa kigailwa suwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Kwaviya want'hu wakwikala Yelusalemu ne vilongozi vawe, hawamanyaga kugamba yehe nie Mkombozi, hawakombaganyaga milosi ya walotezi wa Mnungu yaikilagwa lumwe kila zuwa dya kuhumula. Waitendaga milosi ya walotezi wa Mnungu kunda kindedi kwa kumsengela Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Naho hamwenga na kugamba hawadahile kuwona vikuleka wamsengele kukomwa, wamlombezaga Pilato amsengele kumkoma. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Naho weze wande wadamanya kila kiya kiwandikwe mwa maandiko Akukile kwa yehe, wamselezaga kulawa mwo msalaba niyo wamtambalika mwe kikuta. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Mna Mnungu amwinulaga mo kubanika, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Naho kwa mazuwa mengi awalailaga wadya wose wagendaganya kulawa Galilaya kuita Yelusalemi. Haluse woho ni waona, kwa yehe mwa want'hu wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Nasuwe kiaha kuwegailani Mbuli Yedi. Kiya Mnungu awenk'haga ndagano wakale wetu <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />nicho akudamanya kwetu, suwe ivyezukulu vawe, kwa kumwinula Yesu mwo kubanika enga viya viwandikwe mwe Zabuli ya kaidi kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Weye hwi Mwanangu ywa kilume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">dielo hinda nimiye Iso.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Na ivi nivo alongaga Mnungu yo kuuyuka kwa Yesu, haaole mwe kikuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Nohwink'he uvikilwa we kindedi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">udya namwink'haga ndagano Daudi.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Naho alonga mo Mawandiko Akukile mtuhu kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Mnungu haamneke mtumwa ywakwe msuntilwa aole mwe kikuta.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Mna hiyo Daudi abindaga ndima ya Mnungu, niyo eze abanike wanawe niyo wammosa msanga mwe kikuta, niyo mwili wakwe waola Umwo mwe kikuta. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Mna hivo ivo vilaile kwa yudya auyulwe ni Mnungu mo kubanika. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Wandugu zangu Wazilaeli chaunga mmanye kugamba, kwa sila ya Yesu mwabilikizilwa imbuli yo kuusilwa wavu, <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />na kugamba kila yumwenga akuunga amhuwile Yesu naande mlekelwa kwo wavu udya miko ya Musa heikudaha kuwakombolani. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Mkaulisise, sema yadya yalongigwe na walotezi wa Mnungu yanase yawalaileni nyuwe, kugamba,<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Nyuwe wabezi! Ehelweni naho mfe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Kwa kiya hudamanya dielo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">kint'hu hamkudaha kuhuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">hata uneva mnt'hu ana wagambilani!’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Umwo Paulo na Banaba wandaga wakahalawa he nyumba yo kuvikila, want'hu wawalalikaga, weze naho kwe dizuwa dituhu dya kuhumula vileke weze wawongezele kuwagambila zimbuli izi. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Want'hu weze wahalawe ho mdugano, Paulo na Banaba watimilagwa ni Wayahudi wabindile ingi hamwenga na want'hu watuhu watendigwe kunda Wayahudi, Yesu wawagelaga moyo wadya wegala ulosi kugamba wekale mwo uwedi wa Mnungu.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Zuwa dyo kuhumula ditimile, awengi mo mzi, wezaga kwiva mbuli ya Zumbe. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Wayahudi weze waone idifyo dya want'hu wengilagwa ni finju, niyo wawafingiza want'hu mwa mahinizo ya Paulo no kumhomola. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Paulo na Banaba wagendeelaga kulonga kwa weduvi mkulu wakagamba, “Neviungwa Mbuli ya Mnungu inde kubilikizwa kwenyu aho nk'hongo, mna Kwaviya mlemela, naho hamkukewaza nyuwe wenye kwo ugima wa ulo na ulo, nekimilekeni niyo chaita kwa want'hu hi Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Kwaviya ivi nivo akisigiile Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Himitendani nyuwe mng'aze want'hu hi Wayahudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">vileke want'hu wose we isi wakombolwe.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Want'hu hi Wayahudi weze weve ivo, niyo wengilwa ni kinyemi no kugamba Ulosi wa Mnungu ni mtogolwa, na wadya wose wasagulwe kwingila kwo ugima wa ulo na ulo wandaga wakuhuwila Mnungu.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Ulosi wa Zumbe wenelaga kila hant'hu mwe isi idya. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Vilongozi Wayahudi wawasongelezaga vilongozi we isi na wavele hi Wayahudi wandaga want'hu wakulu wandaga wakamvika Mnungu, niyo wakonga kuwasulumiza Paulo na Banaba no kuwagulusa kulawa mwe isi yawe. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Paulo na Banaba wakung'unt'haga int'hifu ye sanga yandaga mwe viga vawe enga kilagiso cha kuwakanya want'hu wo mzi uwo, niyo wahalawa kuita Ikonia. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Wanamp'hina wa Kilisito wa Antiokia wandaga na kinyemi kikulu, no kumemwa ni Muye ywa Mnungu.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Kudya Ikonia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Kint'hu enga iicho nekilaila uko Ikonia. Paulo na Banaba wengilaga mwe nyumba yo kuvikila no kubilikiza, vitendile wayahudi wengi na want'hu hi Wayahudi wande wahuwila. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Mna wadya Wayahudi wandaga hiwahuwila, wawachakulaga want'hu awo wahuwila hi Wayahudi, na kuwatenda wande wawahiga awa wandugu wahuwila. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Wegala ulosi wekalaga ahadya kwa lupisi lutali wakabilikiza kwa weduvi mwe mbuli ya Mnungu uyo awalagise mo uwedi wakwe na kuwenk'ha udahi wa kudamanya vilagiso na vihungi. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Want'hu mo mzi wakepangaga, wamwenga kwa Wayahudi, wamwenga nao kwe Wegala Ulosi.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Naho wayahudi wamwenga, hamwenga ne vilongozi vawe, wafanyanyaga kuwatendela vihile Wagela Ulosi no kuwatoa maiwe. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Wagela Ulosi weze wabunk'hule ayo wanyilikilaga kwe mizi ya Lisitila na Debe, mwe isi ya Likonia na isi zimgihi mwakwe. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Uko wabilikizaga Mbuli Yedi.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na banaba uko Debe na Lisitila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Uko Lisitila kwandaga mnt'hu kiwete heekudaha kugenda kukongela kwelekwa kwakwe. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Ekalaga aho akategeleza milosi ya Paulo, Paulo amuonaga kugamba ahuwilaga naho naakadaha kuhonyigwa, ivo niyo amkaulisa mnt'hu uyo <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />no kumlonga kwa izwi kulu, “Kimala uchuluke ne viga vako!” Yudya mnt'hu niyo akimaala no kupilika niyo akonga kugenda. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Idifyo dyose dya want'hu dize dione kiya Paulo adamanye, wakongaga kugutila mwe milosi yawe ya Kilikonia, “Milungu indile enga want'hu iza kwetu!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Wamwink'haga Banaba zina dya Zeusi, Paulo naye zina dya Hemesi, kwaviya niye andile mlongi umkulu. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Mlava nt'hambiko ywa Zeusi yumwenga mwe milungu mta nyumba yakwe yandile kuse ludodo ye mzi, egalaga majeku no unga he nk'hili, kwaviya yehe ne difyo dya want'hu waungaga kulava nt'hambiko kwe wegala ulosi wa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Umwo Banaba na Paulo weze weve ivo nawakaunga watende, walwebulaga zisuke zawe kulagisa kulemela kiya nekikalaila, niyo wagenda kukimala mgati mwe nk'hisanyo ya want'hu wakalonga kwa izwi kulu. <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Nii mwadamanya ivi? Suwe na swe kiwant'hu enga nyuwe! Kiaha kwa kubilikiza mbuli ya Mnungu, kuwahitula mfose mwezimbuli hezina ukulu kwa Mnungu ywetu mto udahi aumbile ulanga ne isi ne bahali ne vose viumo. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Uko kale awalekelaga want'hu wadamanye viya wakuunga wenye. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Mna alavaga vilagiso vikulavanya ikindedi cho undiilo wakwe kwa mbuli zedi akudamanya, amwink'hani fula kulawa kulanga, no uwedi kwa hadya ukuunga, amink'hani mkande no kuwenk'hani kinyemi mwe mioyo.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Hamwenga ne milosi iyo ye wegala ulosinevinda vidala kwa kuwafingiza want'hu awo kuwatambikila wegala ulosi.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Wayahudi wamwenga kulawa Antiokia, uko Pisidia, na Ikonia, wawaluvyaga weyawe no kukelunga nao niyo wamtoa Paulo kwa maiwe no kumbulumuila kuse yo mzi wakamanya kugamba kabanika kale. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Mna wanamp'hina wa Kilisito weze wamduganyikile hamwenga, enukilaga niyo auya kwo mzi. Zuwa ditimile yehe na Banaba waitaga uko Debe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwe Silia kuuya Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Paulo na Banaba wabilikizaga Mbuli Yedi uko Debe na want'hu wengi wahuwilaga. Weze walawe aho niyo wauya Lisitila na uko Ikonia hamwenga na Antiokia uko Pesidia. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Wawagelaga nguvu wanamp'hina no kuwasangalaza wekale kindedi mo mhuwi. Wahinizaga kugamba, “Chaungwa kombokela mwe mank'hunto mengi kwo kwingila kwo Useuta wa Mnungu,” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Mwe kila fyo dya wahuwila wa Kilisito, dyasagulaga wadala vilongozi, naho kwa kufunga no kumlombeza Mnungu wawaikaga mo udimi wa Zumbe, waikaga ukawiilo wawe mwa Yehe.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Weze waite kombokela mwe isi ya Pisidia wabulaga Pamfilia. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Kudya wabilikizaga ulosi uko Pega niyo naho waita Atalia, <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />naho weze walawe aho, wagendelaga mwe ngalawa kuuya Antiokia, kudya kunt'hu wakeikaga mo udimi wa uwedi wa Mnungu, no undiilo wakwe kwe ndima idya waibindilize.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Wagela Ulosi weze wabule antokia wawaduganyaga hamwenga want'hu we difyo dya wahuwila wa Kilisito, nokuwagambila yose yadya Mnungu adamanye hamwenga nao, na ivo Mnungu awakomoele wayahudi isila yo kuhuwila. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Naho wekalisaga nawo wanamp'hina.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Kitala uko Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Wezaga want'hu wamwenga walawile Yudeya kwiza Antiokia, no kukonga kuwahiniza wadya wandugu wahuwila kugamba, “Homdahe kuyokolwa uneva hamnavinilwe enga viya miko ya Musa zikuunga.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Paulo na Banaba wengilaga moulafya nawo mwe mbuli ino, ivo yafanyanyagwa kugamba Paulo na Banaba hamwenga na watuhu uko Antiokia waungagwa waite Yelusalemu wakawaone Wegala ulosi hamwenga ne wadala vilongozi we idifyo dya wahuwila wa Kilisito mwe mbuli ino.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Kwaivo nawegalwa ni want'hu wamhuwile Kilisito, naho umwo wandile wakaita kombokela Foeniki Samalia walongaga ya want'hu hi Wayahudi wamhitukilaga Mnungu, ulosi uno wawatendaga wandugu wahuwila wose welelwe. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Weze wabule Yelusalemu wahokelwagwa ni want'hu wamhuwile Kilisito na wegala ulosi, hamwenga na wadala Violongozi. Awo wawagambilaga yose wayadamanye kwa udahi wa Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Mna wahuwila wamwenga we mwe dibunga dya Mafalisayo, wakimalaga na kugamba, “Want'hu hi Wayahudi vaungwa wavinilwe no kugambigwa watimile Miko ya Musa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Wegala ulosi hamwenga ne wadala vilongozi waduganaga hamwenga kutalaula ulosi uwo. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Ulafya uwo mtali wize womboke niyo Petulo akimaala niyo kugamba, “Wandugu zangu mmanya kugamba mazuwa mengi yomboke Mnungu anisagulaga miye mwenyu nibilikize Mbuli Yedi kwa want'hu hi Wayahudi, naivo wadahe kwiva no kuhuwila. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Naho Mnungu amanyize fanyanyi za kila yumwenga, kalonga uwona kwa want'hu hi Wayahudi, kwa kuwenk'ha Muye ywa Mnungu enga viya akitendele suwe. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Kakitenda chose kunda wamwenga, suwe na woho, kawakukiza mioyo yawe kwaviya wamhuwila Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Mwaungilai kumgeza Mnungu kwa kuwatwika wanamp'hina zint'wika izo zidundugwe ni wakale wetu na, hata suwe wenye hakikudaha kuzinula? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Bule! Chahuwila naho wahonywa nu uwedi wa Zumbe Yesu, enga woho ivo weli.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Fyo dyose dyanyamalaga kwaviya nawakawategeleza Banaba na Paulo wakalonga ulosi we vilagiso no kweheela ivo Mnungu avidamanye, mwa ya want'hu hi Wayahudi kombokela kwawe. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Weze wajike kulonga, Yakobo niyo agamba, “Wandugu zangu nitegelezeni! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simoni kasimuila ivo Mnungu mwe nk'hongo alagise kuwazumila kwakwe want'hu hi Wayahudi, kwa kuwasagula wamwenga wawe wande wakwe. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Mbuli ino yazumilana no ulosi wa walotezi wa Mnungu, enga viya Mawandiko Akukilegwe.<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />Zumbe agamba, ‘Akajika neniuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">no kuizenga idya nyumba ya Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">Neniyadamanye mahame yakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">no kuyatenda yatoge naho.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Naivo want'hu watuhu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">want'hu we isi zose niwetange wande wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">nawamzungule Zumbe.<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Nivo akulonga Zumbe, aitendile imbuli ino imanyike kukongela aho kale.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Yakobo agendeelaga kulonga, “Niyo ifanyanyi yangu kugamba kisekuwagela nk'huswank'huswa, want'hu hi Wayahudi wakumhitukila Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Vituhu vakwe kiwawandikileni kuwagambila wasekudya nk'hande zigeligwe usavu kwa kutambikilwa milungu, wakenege no uhabwasi, wasekudya sakame. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Kwaviya mazuwa mengi milosi ya Musa inda ikasomigwa mwe zinyumba zo kuvikila kila zuwa dyo kuhumula, naho mbuli zakwe zibilkizwa mwe kila mzi.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baluwa iwandikwe kwa wahuwila hi Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Wegala ulosi ne wadala vilongozi, hamwenga ne fyo dya wahuwila wa Kilisito wasagulaga want'hu mwawe no kuwawatuma kuita Antiokia wakanda wose na Paulo na Banaba. Wasagulaga want'hu waidi wazumilagwa ni wandugu wahuwila, uyo Yuda akwitangwa Balisaba, na miyawe Sila, <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />niyo wawenk'ha baluwa ino,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:23">“Suwe Wegala Ulosi hamwenga na wadala vilongozi, chamink'hani ndamsa nyuwe wandugu zetu hi Wayahudi, nyuwe mkwikala Antiokia, Asilia, na Kilikia. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Kiva kugamba want'hu watuhu kulawa uku kwetu, wawahanganyani kwe milosi yawe, niyo waigela mioyo yenyu nk'huswank'huswa, Mna wadamanya ivo kwafanyanyi zawe hazilaile kwetu. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Naivo kwa hamwenga kiivana kusagula want'hu no kuwatuma kwenyu. Hamwenga na Banaba na Paulo awo kiwaungile, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />wakuwink'ha ugima wawe kwajili ye dizina dya Zumbe dyetu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Elo ivo chawatuma Yuda na Sila kwenyu, nawawagambileni woho wenye yadya kiwawandikileni. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Naivo Muye ywa Mnungu hamwenga nasuwe kizumila kisekuwatwikani ntwika zijink'hile mbuli izi zikubidi, <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />msekudya nk'hande zilavigwe nt'hambiko kwe vizi mnt'hu, msekunywa sakame, msekudya nyama itile kunyulikwa, naho wink'heni sila uhabwasi, nomde mdamanya vedi uneva hamna yadamanye ayo. Muye yedi.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Weze wawalage, wasigilwa awo wahingaga Antiokia, uko wawaduganyaga wahuwila wa Kilisito niyo wawenk'ha ibaluwa iyo. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Weze waisome iyo ibaluwa, milosi yakwe neiwagela moyo niyo welelwa vitendese. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yuda na Sila kwaviya nawo nawanda walotezi, wasimuilaga mbuli nyingi na wandugu wahuwila wa Kilisito wakawagela moyo no kuwatenda watoge. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Weze wekale ikale uuko, wandugu wahuwila wa Antiokia niyo wawalaga kwa utondowazi niyo wauya kwa wadya wawatumile. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Mna Sila andaga na ulamuzi wa kwikala ahadya.<verse eid="ACT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Paulo na Banaba wekalaga uuko Antiokia kwa lupisi hamwenga na want'hu watuhu wengi, Wahinizagwa no kubilikiza mbuli ya Zumbe.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Balinaba wakepanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Mazuwa yeze yomboke Paulo niyo amgamba Banaba, “Kiuye kikawatalamikile wandugu wadya mwa kila mzi kudya kibilikize mbuli ya Zumbe, kikakaule ivo wakugendeela.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Banaba naakaunga amguhe na Yohana akwitangwa Maliko hamwenga nawo, <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />mna Paulo haone kugamba neviwagilwa wamguhe Yohana Maliko, kwaviya awasaga aho nk'hongo kudya Pamfilia. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Kwandaga na mahigano makulu, niyo wapangana. Banaba amguhaga Yohana Maliko nokukwela ngalawa kuita Kipulo. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Paulo eze amsagule Sila nokuhalawa wandugu wahuwila wa aho nawawaika mo wamizi wo uwedi wa Zumbe. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Mwe nt'hambo iyo nawombokela Asilia, na Kilikia, wakayatenda mafyo ya wahuwila wa Kilisito yatoge<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timoseo akelunga na Paulo na Sila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Paulo abulaga Debe na Lisitila, uko ekalaga mwanamp'hina yumwenga akwitangwa Timoseo. Nine naye andaga mhuwila ywa Kilisito, andaga Myahudi, Mna ise andaga Mgiliki. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Wandugu wahuwila wa Kilisito wa uko Lisitila na Ikonia walongaga uwona wedi mwa Timoseo. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Paulo naakaunga wande wose mwe nt'hambo, ivo niyo amvinila. Nakadamanya ivo kwaviya Wayahudi wose wekale hamwenga mwe ziisi izo nawamanya kugamba ise dya Timotheo andaga Mgiliki. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Umwo wandile wakomboka mwe imizi idya wawenk'haga wadya want'hu miko yalavagwa ni wadala vilongozi ne wegala ulosiku dya Yelusalemu niyo wawagamba wazitoze. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Naivo mafyo ya wahuwila wa Kilisito yatendagwa kunda yatogile mwo mhuwi, nokongezekela kwa wahuwila kila zuwa.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maona ya Paulo uko Toloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Nawombokela Filigia na Galatia na kwaviya Muye ywa Mnungu hawalekele kubilikiza uwo ulosi uko Asia. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Weze wabule mwe mihaka ya Misia, Wagezaga kwingila mwe isi ya Besania, mna Muye ywa Mnungu ywa Yesu hawalekele kutenda ivo. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Ivo nawagenda vedi kombokela, Misia no kuita Toloa. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Mwe kilo kiya Paulo aonaga Maona, akaona want'hu wa Makedonia wakimale wakakeila kwakwe wakagamba, “Paulo wize kaidi Makedonia wize uchambize!” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Aaho Paulo eze aone maona ayo, nakakeikila lumwe kale kuilawa Makedonia, haheina kucheelwa kwaviya nekimanya kugamba Mnungu kakitanga kwiza kubilikiza Mbuli Yedi kwa want'hu wa kudya.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukomboka kwa Ludia uko Ufilipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Nekilawa Toloa, nokutamba kwa ngalawa, mpaka Samosileki, niyo luvi yakwe chaika nt'hulwe Neapoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Kilawa uko nokuita mpaka Ufilipi mzi mkulu we wilaya ya nk'hongo ya Makedonia naho wandaga ni uzumbe wa Waloma. Chahekalisaga hadya. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Zuwa dyo kuhumula chafosaga kuse niyo chaita hank'handa yo mto, hant'hu Wayahudi wakutendelaga mviko kwa Mnungu, chekalaga kikasimuila na wavele wakeduganyaga aho. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Mwa wadya wandaga wakakitegeleza, andaga umwo mvele yumwenga, akumvika Mnungu, akwitangwa Ludia, mkaya ywa Tiatila andaga akataga suke za utana utendese. Zumbe niyo augubula umoyo wakwe niyo ayahokela yadya alongile Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Uyo mvele hamwenga na nine na wandugu zawe weze wajike kubatizwa, niyo akilalika akagamba, “Uneva nikindedi muwona kugamba miye namhuwila Zumbe, soni mwikale kwe nyumba yangu.” Niyo adifumbigiza kiite.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwe divugailo uko Filipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Zuwa dimwenga umo chaitaga mwo kuvika na mndele mtumwa yumwenga andaga na mp'hepo yandaga ika mwink'ha udahi kukawiila mbuli zikwiza, uyo mtumwa mndele naakawapatila mazumbe wakwe matundu yabindile ingi yakulawa mo ulaguzi wakwe. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Mndele uyo ambasaga Paulo na suwe, akagutiila akagamba, “Want'hu awa ni wandima wa Mnungu Mkulu! Nawagambileni ivo mkudaha kukombolwa!” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Niyo anda akadamanya ivo kwa mazuwa mengi, mpaka zuwa dimwenga Paulo niyo aihiwa, no kumhitukila no kumgamba yudya mp'hepo, “Nakuunga umlawe mnt'hu uyo haluse ivi, kwe dizina dya Yesu Kilisito!” Aaho niyo mp'hepo yamlawa.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Wadya wagoli weze waone makawiilo yawe yo kupata matundu yasila, niyo wawagwila Paulo na miyawe Sila, niyo wawabulumula mpaka kwe kitala kwa wakulu. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Wawegalaga kwe kitala wakawalongeleza kugamba, “Want'hu awa ni Wayahudi wakigela nk'humbizi mo mzi wetu. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Wahiniza vihendo hivo vetu, suwe kiwa Lumi, hakikudaha kuvizumila na kuvidamanya.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Niyo want'hu wose kwahamwenga wawa kumpukilaga Paulo na Miyawe Sila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">Wasenga masa wawahambulaga zisuke Paulo na Sila, niyo wawenk'hiza vileke watoigwe mikotya. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Weze wajike kutoigwa kwa usungu niyo wasukumilwa kwe divugailo, niyo wadya wamizi wasigiilwa kuwakakiliza mp'hingu. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Weze wahokele miko iyo, wamizi we divugailo wawagelaga, kwe chumba cha kundani mwedivugailo niyo wakakilizwa iviga vawe mwe difingo.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu waidi wakakigwa mwe difingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Mna mwe kilogati, Paulo na Sila wandaga wakakema mila ya kumlombeza Mnungu, wadya wavugailwa weyawe nawo wandaga wakawategeleza. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Aaho niyo halaila kisingisa, chasingisaga milango ye divugailo niyo yakomoka, zimp'hingu nazo wakakilizilwe wadya wavugailwa zatohokaga. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Mwamizi ywe divugailo enukaga, eze aone zinyivi ze divugailo zikomoka, naakagamba wavugailwa wanyilika. Ivo niyo asomola digola dyakwe akaunga akekome. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Mna Paulo niyo agutila kwa izwi kulu, “Usekukekoma! Suwe chose kiaha!”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Mwamizi alagizaga lumuli no kugulukila kundani, uku akazingiza he viga va Paulo na Sila. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Niyo awalongoza kuse nokuwauza, “Nyuwe wakulu, nitende vivihi niyokolwe?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Niyo wamhitula, “Mhuwile Zumbe Yesu, nouyokolwe weye na want'hu mwe mp'huga yako.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Niyo wabilikiza mbuli ya Zumbe kwa yudya mwamizi na want'hu watuhu wose mwe inyumba yakwe. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Kukongela hadya, yudya mwamizi awaguhaga Paulo na Sila no kusunt'ha zinkwenge zawe, aaho niyo yehe hamwenga na wanawe wabatizwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Niyo awaguha Paulo na Sila kwe kaya yakwe no kuwenk'ha nk'hande. Yehe na wanawe wose wandaga na kinyemi kikulu kwaviya haluse nawaka mhuwila Mnungu.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Zuwa dya kaidi mtondo, uzumbe we Kiloma, watumaga wakulu wawank'hondo, ne miko kugamba, “Walekeleni want'hu awo waite.” <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Ivo yudya mwamizi awagambaga Paulo na Sila, “Wakulu wasigiila mfosezwe, elo foseni mwite kwa utondowazi.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Mna Paulo niyo awagamba wamizi hachaoneke na masa yoyose, “Mna wakitoa mikotya mwe kieti, naswe Kiwaloma! Niyo naho wakigela kwe divugailo naho haluse waunga wakilekele kwa kinyele, Hivo ivo! Chaunga wakulu wenye we Kilumi weze wakilekele.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Wadya wakulu waamizi wagendaga kuwagambila ivo wakulu we Kilumi, weze weve kugamba Paulo na Sila ni Walumi, niyo wogoha. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Ivo wawabasaga Paulo na Sila niyo wakeila kwawe, naho wawalongozaga kuse ye divugailo na kuwagamba wahalawe ho mzi. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Paulo na Sila niyo wafosa kwedivugailo, niyo waita kwe nyumba ya Ludia. Hadya nawabwila wandugu wahuwila wa Kilisito, wawenk'haga milosi ya kugela moyo, niyo wahalawa.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Paulo na Sila mwe Tesaloniki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Paulo na Sila waitaga wokombokela Amfipoli na Apolonia, no kwingila Sesalonike uko kwandaga ne nyumba ya kuvikila ya Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Kwaviya azoele, Paulo aitaga kwe nyumba ya kuvikila. Andaga aaho kwa majuma matatu akalonga na want'hu wakahigana mwe Mawandiko Yakukile, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />akawagambila ikindedi kugamba, vaungwa Kilisito asulumizwe no kwinuka kulawa mo kubanika. “Niye Yesu huwagambilani.” Paulo niyo agamba, “niye Kilisito Mkombozi.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Wamwenga wawe nawazumila no kumtimila Paulo na Sila, na wavele wengi hamwenga na fyo kulu dya Wagiliki wandaga wakamvika Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Mna Wayahudi wandaga wawaonelega gaina wakina Paulo na miyawe sila, wawaduganyaga want'hu wahezi heweina ndima, mwe zisila, niyo watenda kafyo, niyo wawagamba wadamanye fyo mo mzi wose vileke waitahe nyumba ya mnt'hu yumwenga akwitangwa Yasoni, enga mzungu wa kuwapata Paulo na Sila, na kuwegala kwa want'hu ao. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Mna weze wawaswese, niyo wamgwila Yasoni na wamwenga mwa wanduguze, niye wawegala kwa wakulu we isi wakagutila wakagamba, “Want'hu awa waleta nk'humbizi kila hant'hu! Haluse weza mwo mzi wetu, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Yasoni naye kawahokela kwakwe, wose kwa hamwenga wabananga Imiko ya Seuta ywa Loma, wakagamba hambwe eyuko Zumbe mtuhu akwitangwa Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Wakulu wo mzi na want'hu wose weze weve ivo, niyo wengilwa ni kituletule. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Niyo wawatoza mhambulo Yasoni na weyawe, no kuwalekela waite.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Sila watumwa Belea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Kilo kize kibule wandugu wahuwila, wawegalaga Paulo na Sila uko Belea, Weze wabule niyo wengila kwe Nyumba ya Kuvikila ya Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Want'hu wa Belea wandaga wabala wanaumanyi kuwajink'ha want'hu wa Sesalonike, nawakategeleza ulosi kwa kunyemwanyemwa nk'hulu, naho kila zuwa nawakakehiniza mo Mawandiko Akukile vileke wakaule ikindedi che milosi ya Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Wengi wawe wahuwilaga, naho hata wavele wengi, wakulu we Kigiliki, na wagosi we Kigiliki nawo wahuwilaga. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Mna wayahudi wa Sesalonike weze wabunk'hule kugamba Paulo abilikiza mbuli ya Mnungu uko Belea wakongaga kutenda nk'humbizi, na kusongeza idifyo dya want'hu. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Wadya wandugu wahuwila niyo wasunguza kumsindikiza Paulo aite mp'wani, mna Sila na Timoseo wasigalaga Belea. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Wadya want'hu wamsindikize Paulo na waitanyaga nae mpaka Asene, niyo wauya na miko kugamba Sila na Timoseo wa mtimile nguvu kwavovose vikudahika.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo uko Asene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Umwo Paulo andile akawagoja Silana na Timoseo uko Asene, engilaga kinyulu Kwaviya aonaga ivo mzi umemile milungu vimumu. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Ivo wandaga wakalava na Wayahudi na wannt'hu watuhu mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, na want'hu watuhu nawakamvika Mnungu, naho kila zuwa naakalangilizana na want'hu wowose wakelavilizaga. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Wamwenga nawatimila umanyi wa Epikulo na Sitoiki, nawakahigana naye. Wamwenga nawauza, “Aunga akigambile ubwalasi wani uyu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Wamwenga niyo wahitula, “Uyu naakabilikiza Mbuli ya milungu mihya.” Nawakalonga ivo kwaviya Paulo naaka bilikiza Mbuli ya Yesu no kuuyuka. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Ivo niyo wamguha Paulo no kumwigala kwe kitala dyo mzi dikwitangwa Aleopago, wakamgamba, “Chaunga kimanye mahinizo aya mahya ukuhiniza. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Vint'hu vimwenga kikuviva ukulonga, ni maizwi mahya kwetu naho nekikaungisa kivimanye vagaaze.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Kwaviya wekazi awengi wa Asene, na wadya wageni, wandaga wakekala hadya wakaungisa kutenda lupisi lwawe kusimulizilana no kwiva mbuli mp'hya. <verse eid="ACT 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Paulo akimaalaga kulongole ye kitala dyo mzi wa Aleopago niyo agamba, “Hiona kugamba kwavovose, nyuwe want'hu wa Asene mu want'hu waidi kindedi ndedi. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Kwaviya higenda mo mzi no kuwona mudya mkutendela miviko yenyu, hiviona vilingo viwandikwe, ‘Kwa Mnungu heemanyike’. Uyo mkumvika, hata uneva hamummanyize uyo niye huwabilikizilani. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Mnungu, adamanye isi na kila kiyumo mndani, niye Zumbe ywa kulanga ne isi, heekwikala mwe nyumba nk'hulu Izengigwe kwe mikono ya want'hu. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Naho hahungukilwe ni dyodyose kikudaha kumdamanyila, kwaviya niyehe mwenye akukink'ha ugima, no muye, na kila kint'hu kituhu kwa want'hu wose. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Kulawa mwa mnt'hu yumwenga Mnungu aumbaga want'hu wose mwe isi no kuwenk'ha udahi wa wikazi kwenela mwe isi yose, Afanyanyaga no kupanga iviya kukei kugamba niini, naho ni hii want'hu awo nawekale. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Nakatenda ivo vileke want'hu awo wamzungule hata uneva kwa kubabasa babasa wadahe kumbwiila, hata ivo mna Mnungu he hale na suwe chose, <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />enga viya mnt'hu yumwenga alongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Mwa yehe suwe chekala, chekedaha, na naho kiyuko.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Ni enga viya wakemi wenyu ivo walongile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Suwe naswe kiwanawe.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Haluse uneva suwe kiwana Mnungu hakikuungwa kumfanyanya Mnungu enga hili dya zahabu, hili dya matundu, hegudu hata iwe disongolwe ni mnt'hu no kugeligwa unt'handa. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Aho handaga ho uhezi, Mnungu aketendaga enga hakuona, mna haluse asigiila want'hu wose kila hant'hu wakeiile. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Kwaviya kaika kale dizuwa dyo usengelo we isi kwaviya viwagile, kombokela kwa mnt'hu yumwenga amsagule, Mnungu kawalavilizila wose imbuli ino kwa kumuuyula mnt'hu uyo.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Weze weve Paulo alonga imbuli yo kuuyuka, niyo wamwenga watumbula seko, mna wamwenga niyo wagamba, “Chaunga kikwive ukalonga imbuli ino naho.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Ivo Paulo niyo ahalawa hekitala. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Mna want'hu wamwenga niyo wamtimila Paulo, niyo wahuwila. Yumwenga mwa woho andaga ni Dionisio wa Aleopago yumwenga wa want'hu wekitala, na mvele yumwenga akwitangwa Damali hamwenga na watuhu.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Paulo uko Kolinso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Akajika aho, Paulo ahalawaga Asene no kuita Kolinso. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Uko ambwilaga Myahudi yumwenga akwitangwa Akula, mwelekwa ywa Ponto, Akula hamwenga na mkaziwe akwitangwa Pilisikila wauyaga kulawa Italia mwa mazuwa aayo, kwaviya Kaisalia Kilaudia andaga kasigiila Wayahudi wose wakulawe Loma. Paulo agendaga kuwakaula, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />naho kwaviya wandaga ni wata umanyi wa kusuma mahema enga yehe, Paulo ekalaga nao akadamanya ndima iidya nawakadamanya. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Kila zuwa dyo kuhumula andaga na ulafya mwe zinyumba za Mnungu, akageza kuwavuta Wayahudi na Wagiliki.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Umwo Timoseo na Sila weze wauye kulawa Makedonia, Paulo nakakelavya lupisi lwakwe lutali kubilikiza ulosi no kuwalavanyila Wayahudi kugamba Yesu Kilisito niye Masiha. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Mna Wayahudi weze wamhige no kumhomola, akung'unt'haga zisuke zakwe availe mwa meso yawe, akawagamba, “Uneva mkaga ni nyuwewenye, miye henikalalizwe kwa dyodyose mwe idi! Naho kukongela ivi haluse neniwabase want'hu hi Wayahudi.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Ivo elo kulawa aho niyo agenda kwikala kwa mnt'hu yumwenga hi Myahudi akwitangwa Tito Yusito, uyo inyumba yakwe yandaga hagihi ne Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, inyumba yakwe yandaga ya kaidi kulawa he nyumba yo kuvikila. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kilisipo, uyo andaga mkulu wenyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, yehe ne nyumba yakwe yose wamhuwilaga Zumbe, na want'hu watuhu wengi mwe Kolinso wevaga ulosi, wahuwilaga naho wabatizwagwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Kilo kimwenga mwa maona, Zumbe amgambaga Paulo, “Use kogoha gendeela kubilikiza, naho use kuhwa moyo, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />kwaviya miye nihamwenga na weye hahali yeyose akuunga ageze kukunyulika, kwaviya ho mzi uno weyaho want'hu wangu.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Ivo Paulo niyo ekala uuko akahiniza mbuli ya Mnungu kwawe kwa mwaka umwenga na nusu.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Mna umwo Galiyo andaga mkulu wo mkoa wa Akaya, Wayahudi wamkumpukilaga Paulo kwa hamwenga niyo wa mwigala kwe kitala. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Want'hu awa wagambaga, “Mnt'hu uyu,” “awatenda want'hu wamvike Mnungu kwe sila ikuhigana ne miko!”<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Paulo andaga akei kulonga, Galiyo nakawagamba Wayahudi, “Tegelezani nyuwe wayahudi, Uneva mbuli ino yandile kindedi mwe wavu abanange, hegu nehimitegelezani. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Mna uneva ni mbuli ya mahigano mwe milosi, na mazina, na miko yenyu, Lamuleni nyuwe wenye miye heninde mlamuzi mwe zimbuli izi.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Niyo awagulusa hekitala. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Woseni hamwenga niyo wamgwila Sositenesi uyo andile mkulu we Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, niyo wamtowa hameso ye kitala. Mna Galiyo haone ukulu we mbuli iyo hata hadodo. <verse eid="ACT 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Paulo agendeelaga kwikala na wadya wandugu wahuwila wa Kolinso kwa mazuwa mengi, ahalawe aho niyo ahalawa no kukwela ingalawa kuita Asilia, hamwenga na Pilisikila, na Akula uko Kenk'helea, eze amoge mtwi wakwe kwe kilapi aikaga. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Wabulaga Uefeso, aho niho Paulo awalekaga want'hu wa Pilisikila na Akula, niyo aita mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, niyo wanda wakalawa na Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Wamlombezaga ekale nao lupisi lutali, mna yehe haungile. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Mna Umwoakahalawa nakawagamba, “Mnungu anaunga neniwauiyeni naho.” Niyo agendeela mwe ngalawa kuita Efeso.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Eze abule Kaisalia, Paulo niyo agenda kuwalamsa want'hu wamhuwile Kilisito uko Yelusalemu, akajika aho niyo aita Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Ekalaga uko mazuwa hi mengi niyo agendeela ne nt'hambo kwa kombokela mtendelo za Galatia na Filigia akawagela nguvu wanamp'hina wose.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolo abilikiza Efeso na uko Kolinso.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Myahudi yumwenga akwitagwa Apolo mwelekwa ywa Alekizandilia, Nakeza kwa Waefeso. Andaga ni mnt'hu mloga kindedi naho mta umanyi mkulu mwa Mawandiko Yakukile ywe mbuli ya Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Nakahinyizwa mwe Sila ya Zumbe, naho akanda no lubwikanizi, asimulizilaga mbuli ya Yesu, naho ahinizaga mwe kindedi, hamwenga na kugamba nakamanya ubatizo wa Yohana uuwo du. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Akongaga kuhiniza kwa weduvi mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu. Pilisikila na Akula weze wamwive ivo akusimuila, niyo wamguha waitanye kwawe kaya wakamhiniza vedi Isila ya Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Apolo eziilagwa ni ulamuzi wo kuita Akaya, wadya wandugu wahuwila nawamgela nguvu kwa kuwagondela wanamp'hina wa kudya Akaya vileke wamhokele. Eze abule kudya, kwa wambizi wa uwedi wa Mnungu, nakadaha kuwambizisa wadya wahuwila wenk'higwe kunda wahuwila. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Kwa uhigi wakwe mkulu nakawahuma Wayahudi mwekiyeti akalavanya kwa Mawandiko Akukile kugamba Yesu Kilisito niye Masiha.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Paulo abilikiza kwa Waefeso.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Umwo Apolo andaga Kolinso, Paulo ombokelaga mgati gati ye isi niyo abula Efeso uko awabwiilaga wanamp'hina wamwenga <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />niyo awauza, “Mwamhokelaga Muye ywa Mnungu aho mwize mnde wahuwila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Niyo wamhitula, “Hata ukwiva kugamba eyuko Muye ywa Mnungu hakinati,”<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />“Vedi, Elo, mhokela ubatizo wa vivihi?” Niyo wamhitula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">“Kibatizwa udya ubalizo wa Yohana du,”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Paulo niyo agamba, “Ubatizo wa Yohana wandaga kwa wadya walekile wavu wawe, naho awagambaga want'hu wa Izilaeli wamhuwile yumwenga akwiza kunyuma yakwe, nuko kugamba ni Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Weze weve ivo, niyo wabatizwa kwe dizina dya Zumbe Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Paulo awagelekaga mikono niyo Muye ywa Mnungu aweziila, walongaga kwe milosi mihya no kugendeza kose ulosi wa Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Wandaga wabuile wagosi mlongo na waidi mwa want'hu wose.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Paulo aitaga kwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, naho kwa mazuwa milongo kanda andaga akalonga kwa weduvi na want'hu, akalangilizana nao no kugeza kuwalagilisa ikindedi cho Useuta wa Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Mna wamwenga nawanda wamkulano, naho walemela kuhuwila, no kukonga kulonga vihile mwe iyo isila ya Zumbe mwe want'hu wengi wadugane. Aho Paulo niyo apangana nao, niyo aguha wadya wanamp'hina wakwe, akasimuila nawo mazuwa yose mwe dizumba dyo kuhinila dya mnt'hu akwitangwa Tulanosi. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Agendeelaga kutenda ivo kwa myaka miidi, vitendile wekazi wose wa Asia, Wayahudi, na watuhu hi wayahudi wevaga imbuli ya Zumbe.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana Sekewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Mnungu adamanyaga vilagiso va kweheela kwa Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Want'hu wandaga wakaguha vitambala ne zisuke zint'huhu andaga akavala akanda mwe ndima, Paulo azigala kwa wanyonge, wanyonge niyo wahonywa maine yawe, nawadya wandile ne zi mp'hepo niyo wahonywa. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Wayahudi wamwenga waitaga uko na uko wakaditumia zina dya Zumbe Yesu, kwa wadya wavalukwe ni mp'hepo, wandaga wakagamba “Nawagambani kwe dizina dya Yesu yudya akubilikizwa ni Paulo.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Wabwanga mfungate wa Sikewa Mlava Nt'hambiko mkulu wa Wayahudi, wandaga wakatenda ivo.<verse eid="ACT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Mna uyo mp'hepo niyo awahitula, “Himmanya Yesu, naho himmanya Paulo, mna nyuwe ni nyuwe wahi?”<verse eid="ACT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Niyo yudya avalukwe awapilikila kwa nguvu wadya want'hu niyo awahuma nguvu wana Sikewa no kuwatatuila zisuke. Watulaga nguluko waka wakafosa kwe nyumba idya wekimbwigili, naho wagelwa nkwenge. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Kila mnt'hu uko Efeso, ande Wayahudi na hi Myahudi, waivaga imbuli iyo, niyo wengilwagwa ni wogofi no kutogolesa dizina dya Zumbe Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Wahuwila wengi wakelavilizaga niyo walonga mwe kiyeti zimbuli wandaga wakadamanya. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Wose wadya wandaga wasai wavigalaga vitabu vawe kwa hamwenga no kuvoka moto mwekiyeti. Wawazaga diyombe dye vitabu ivo dyabulaga matundu yakulihwa mnt'hu kwa zuwa, magana mlongo milongo mishano. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Naivo kwa udahi wa Zumbe ulosi wa Mnungu wandaga ukongezekela kugendezwa no kukulisa.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nk'humbizi mwe Efeso.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Yeze yomboke ayo Paulo aungaga kuita Yelusalemu, kwa kombokela Makedonia na Akaya, Nakagamba. “Hajika kuita uko, hawaone wa Loma nao.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Ivo nakawatuma waidi mwa wambizi wakwe, Timoseo na Elasito, walongole kuita Makedonia, Yehe niyo anda kusigala kwa mazuwa mageke kwo mkowa wa Asia.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Aha niho halailaga nk'humbizi uko Efeso mwe mbuli ye sila iyo ya Zumbe Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Kwandaga na msana vilama etangagwa Demetilio, adamanyaga mahili ye nyumba ya mnungu wa kivele akwitagwa Atemi, naho ndima iyo yawenk'haga wasani wakwe kint'hu kikulu. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Demetilio awa kisanyaga wasani ao hamwenga na watuhu wandaga ne indima iyo no kuwagamba, “Mmanya kugamba ugoli wetu walawa mwe ndima ino. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Haluse mwadaha kukeonela wenye ivo Paulo akutenda. Agamba milungu idamanywe ni want'hu hiyo milungu ya kindedi, naho kadaha kuwapata want'hu wengi, aha Efeso na hata kutuhu mo mkowa wa Asia yose. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Kuna nk'hondo kugamba, diyombe dyetu nedipate zina diihile. Hiyo ivo du mna yadahika kunda nyumba ya mnungu Atemi kunda hicho kint'hu cha ukulu no ukulu wakwe uyo akuvikwa ni Asia ne isi yose noubanangwe. Ulungu ukuvikwa nikila yumwenga mwe Asia ne isi yose!”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Idifyo dize dive mbuli izi niyo dyanywa maya no kukonga kugutila wakagamba, “Atemi wa Efeso niye mkulu!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Mzi wose niyo wenela nk'humbizi. Idifyo niyo dwawakump'hukila Gayo na Alistaliko, wakaya wa Makedonia watafi weyawe wa Paulo, niyo waguluka nao mpaka kwo ukumbi we misezigo. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Paulo yehe mwenye aungaga kukelaviliza ha meso ye difyo, mna wanamp'hina weyawe wamfingizaga. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Wakulu wamwenga we isi ya Asia wandaga wambuyaze dya Paulo, wamwigailaga ulosi wakamlombezesa Paulo kugamba ase kuke laviliza kwo ukumbi we misezigo. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Aaho aho kila mnt'hu andaga akavava, uyu ivi na watuhu ivi, niyo udya mdugano wabanika, kwaviya wengi hawamanyaga kiya kiwatendile wadugane hamwenga. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Wamwenga nawamtenda Alekizanda ande na chokulonga, kwaviya Wayahudi nawamtenda aite kulongole. Ivo niyo Alekizanda awalagisa want'hu kwa kuhunga mkono akaunga wanyamale, niyo ageza kukegombela kwa ulosi wakwe. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Mna weze wabunk'hule kugamba yehe ni Myahudi, wagutiilaga wose wakalonga imbuli iidya kwa masaa maidi, “Atemi niye mkulu wa Efeso!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Ukouko kalani wo mzi adahaga kuwanyamaza want'hu akagamba, “Wandugu Waefeso!” Kila yumwenga kamanya kugamba mzi uno wa Efeso ni mwamizi mkulu we nyumba yo mkulu Atemi, naho ni mwamizi we diiwe dyo kuvila diselezwe kulawa kulanga. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Hahali akudaha kulemela zimbuli izo, ivo nyamaleni msekudamanya dyodyose haheina wengele. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Muwetanga want'hu awa aha hata uneva hawailongile vihile nyumba ya mnungu naho hata uneva hawamhomole mnungu ywetu ywe kivele. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Mna uneva Demetilio na wandima wakwe wana malongelezo yawe kwa yeyose, yeyaho mazuwa yekitala masa yakudaha yakalahigwa uko. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Mna uneva kiuko kint'hu kituhu kujink'ha icho, ikaleni mwe mdugano ukuzumilwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Kwaviya iyuko nk'hondo kugamba nekilongelezwe kwe nk'humbizi idya yadielo, nk'humbizi ino hayawagilwe ilaile, hekilekelwe mwe nk'humbizi ino, naho hegu nekidunduga kukehonya kwa vovose mwe nk'humbizi iyo. <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Eze abinde kulonga ivi, alekaga want'hu wa mdugano wakeagale.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Kuita Makedonia na Uyunani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Nk'humbizi ize itondowale, Paulo awetangaga wanamp'hina kwa milosi ya kugela moyo awalagaga niyo ahalawa no kuita Makedonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Ambokelaga mwe ziisi zia zose akawagela want'hu nguvu kwa milosi mingi, Niyo abula Uyunani. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Ekalaga uko kwa miyezi mitatu. Akeikaga lumwe kuita Asilia, aho eze abunk'hule kugamba Wayahudi wandaga wakampangila maihi, ivo niyo atenda ulamuzi wa kuuya na kombokela Makedonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Sopatolo mwana Pihilo kulawa Belea, niye atimilane naye, iviyaiviya Alistaliko hamwenga na Sekudo kulawa Sesalonike, Gayo kulawa Debe, Tukiko, na Tolofimo kulawa kwo mkowa Asia, na Timoseo. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Wakilongoelaga no kukigojela Toloa. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Chaitaga kwa ngalawa kulawa Ufilipi ize yomboke siku kuu ye mikate heigwadulwe, naho yeze yomboke mazuwa mashano, chakelungaga nao umwo Toloa, uko chekalaga mazuwa mfungate.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo abindiziza kuitalamkila Toloa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Mwe dizuwa dya nk'hongo dye dijuma, cha duganaga vileke kibendule umkate. Kwaviya Paulo naakakawiila kuhalawa luvi yakwe, aguhaga lupisi lutali akalonga na want'hu viitile mpaka kilo gati. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Vakwelezwagwa vimuhi vingi mwe nyumba ye golofa umwo waduganaga, <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />mbwanga yumwenga etangagwa Eotiko, andaga kekala hedilanga, umwo Paulo andaga akagendeela kubilikiza. Eutiko akongaga kukupila mp'halahole niyo atozwa ni nt'hongo niyo apalanyukila hasi. Weze wamwinule andaga kabanika kale. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Mna Paulo aseelaga hasi, niyo afunama no kumkunyatila, niyo agamba, “Msekunda na kiyangayanga,” “akei mgima!” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Niyo Paulo akwela naho kwegolofa no kubendula umkate niyo adya, nakagendeela kubilikiza kwa lupisi lutali mpaka mtondo, niyo Paulo ahalawa. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Want'hu wadya waitanyaga na yudya Mbwanga kaya akanda mgima ngungulu, niyo wanda welelwa.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kulawa Toloa kuita Mileto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Chakwelaga mwe ngalawa niyo chalongola kuita Aso kudya nekikamguha Paulo. Nivo apangaga kwaviya aungaga kombokela mwe isi nk'havu. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Eze akibwiile kudya Aso, chamkwezaga mwe ngalawa no kuita Mitulene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Kulawa uko chatambaga no mpaka Kio, mwe dizuwa ditimile, zuwa dya kaidi chaikaga nt'hulwe uko Samo, naho luvi yakwe niyo chengila Mileto. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Paulo aungaga kugendeela no utafi we ngalawa haheina kombokela Efeso, vileke asunguze uko kwo mkowa wa Asia, andaga ne kinguvu nguvu cho mpaka Yelusalemu kwe wila ye Pent'hekosite uneva vadahike.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo awalaga vilongozi wadala wa Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Kulawa Mileto Paulo atumaga ulosi kwa vilongozi wadala we idifyo dya wahuwila wa Kilisito dya Efeso vileke wadugane nae. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Weze wabule kwakwe awagambaga, “Mmanya ivo nikale na nyuwe mazuwa yose, kukongela mwe dizuwa dia dya nk'hongo hadya nabulaga momkowa wa Asia. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Kwa kweseleza kose nadamanyaga ndima ya Zumbe molupisi lwa makunt'ho yanipatile kulawa kwe minyanyiko iihile ya Wayahudi wamwenga. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Mmanya kugamba hyandile na nk'hangamizi hata ludodo kuwabilikiza mwe kieti, na mwezinyumba zenyu, no kuwahiniza chochose chadahile kuwambizani. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Nehiwagamba Wayahudi, na hi Wayahudi, wamhitukile Mnungu no kumhuwila Zumbe dyetu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Naho haluse, uku hamtegeleza Muye ywa Mnungu, naita Yelusalemu haheina kumanya yakuunga yanilaile uko. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Kiya humanya ni kugamba Muye ywa Mnungu naakanilavanyila mwe kila mzi kugamba kuvugailwa na masulumizo yangu nayo yakunigojela. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Mna hiuone ugima wangu kunda kint'hu kitendese, mna du niunk'hintize udya utume wangu ne ndima idya nink'higwe ni Zumbe Yesu niidamanye, niilonge mwa want'hu Mbuli Yedi ya uwedi wa Mnungu.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />“Homboka mwa wamwenga mwa nyuwe habilikiza Useuta wa Mnungu, mna himanya haluse kugamba hahali yumwenga mwa nyuwe naanione naho. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Ivo dielo nawalavanyilani kugamba, ineza kulaila yumwenga ywenyu kaga, Miye hina kukalalizwa kokose. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Kwaviya hindile na nk'hangamizi mo kuwagambila kukawiila kose akuunga Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Mkeamile nyuwewenye hamwenga ne difyo diya Muye ywa Mnungu awenk'hileni mdilele. Dimeni awant'hu we idifyo dya wahuwila wa Kilisito dya Mnungu wadya awapatile kwa kulava sakame ya mwanawe mwenye. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Hivimanyisa vedi kugamba nnahalawa mauzi makali nayadikome naho hayadisigaze idifyo idyo. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Hata mwa nyuwe wenye nawalaile want'hu wakuunga wawadant'hilize wanamp'hina wa Kilisito no kuwatenda wawatimile woho du. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Ivo indeni meso mkakumbukila kugamba kwa masulumizo, mengi kilo na msi, nawahinizagani kila yumwenga ywenyu kwa myaka mitatu.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />“Haluse nawaika nyuwe hasi yo udimi wa Mnungu, no ulosi wo wedi wa wakwe, udya ukudaha kuwazenga na kuwagela nguvu, mpate uvikilwa udya awaikile want'hu wakwe wose wakukizwe. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Miye hyaungise matundu hegu zahabu, hegu suke za mnt'hu yeyose. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Nyuwe wenye mmanya hidamanya ndima kwa mikono yangu mwenye vileke nikepatile yadya huunga na wambuyazangu. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Hiwalagisani kwa kila kint'hu kugamba kwa kudamanya ndima enga ivo, kiwambize hewekukedaha, kikakumbukila milosi ya Zumbe Yesu mwenye akagamba, ‘Wiyuko uvikilwa mkulu mo kuwenk'ha wakiwa vint'hu, kujink'ha kukuhokela vint'hu kwa want'hu’.”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Paulo eze abinde kulonga ayo, afikaga madi na want'hu wose niyo wamvika Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Wose nawanda wakaila, na kumtoza Paulo mkono no wakamlaga kwa lukunde lukulu. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Mbuli itendese yawageile kinyulu niidya agambile, hawadahe kumuwona naho, naivo niyo wamsindikiza kwe ngalawa.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Paulo aita Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Kize chajike kulagana nao, chakwelaga mwe ngalawa mpaka Kosi, luvi yakwe chabulaga Lode, na kulawa uko nekiita Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Uko nekibwiila ngalawa yandile ikaita Foeniki, niyo chakwela no kukonga utafi. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Cha wabulaga hant'hu nekikadaha kuiona Kipulo niyo chombokela nt'hendelo ya kusini yo mzi wa Asilia. Chaitaga Tilo, aho ingalawa yaselezwagwa mizigo yakwe. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Uko chabwiilaga wanamp'hina wa Kilisito niyo chekala nao juma dimwenga wahuwila wa Kilisito ao walonga kwa udahi wa Muye ywa Mnungu, niyo wamgamba Paulo usekuita Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Mna lupisi lwetu wize usile niyo chahalawa, wavele na wana wawe hamwenga wakisindikizaga mpaka kuse yo mzi, kize kibule mp'wani wose chafikaga madi no kumvika Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Niyo chalagana, suwe chakwelaga mwe ngalawa, woho nao niyo wauya kwezikwawe.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Chahalawaga kuita Tilo, niyo chabula Tolemaisi aho chawalamsaga wandugu wahuwila wa Kilisito zetu, niyo chekalanya nao zuwa dimwenga. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Luvi yakwe chahalawaga kuita Kaisalia. Uko chekalaga kwe nyumba ya mbilikizi we Mbuli Yedi Filipo, yehe andaga mwa wadya mfungate wasagulwa kunda wambizi kudya kwe fyo dya wahuwila wa Kilisito dya Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Andaga na wanawe wane wa kivele hewelombigwe wandaga wakalonga ulosi wa Mnungu wandaga wakenk'hingwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Kize kikale uko mazuwa mengi, mlotezi ywa Mnungu yumwenga akwitangwa Agabo wa Yudeya abulaga. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Akibasaga niyo aguha mkoa wa Paulo, nokukekakiliza mikono ne viga niyo agamba, “Muye ywa Mnungu agamba, mta mkoa uno naakakilizwe enga ivi ni Wayahudi kudya Yelusalemu, no kumgela mwe mikono ya want'hu hewemmanyize Mnungu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Kize kive ivo, suwe na wadya want'hu watuhu nekilombezesa Paulo asekuita Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Mna Paulo niyo awahitula, “Mwadamanyai? Ivo mkuta kuila no kunikant'ha tama? Miye hikeika lumwe hiyo kuvugailwa du kudya Yelusalemu, mna hata ukubanika mwe mbuli ya Zumbe Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Nekidunduga kumluvya Paulo, niyo chabanika chevu niyo chagamba, “Viya aungile Zumbe nevinde iivo.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Kize kikale hadya kwa Lupisi niyo chakeikilaga lumwe kugendeela no utafi kuita Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Wamwenga mwa wanamp'hina kulawa Kaisalia, chaitanyaga, niyo wakigala kwe nyumba yo mhula ywa Kilisito chandaga kikagenda kwikala naye. Mnasoni mkaya wa Kipulo andaga mhula ywa Kilisito kukongela mazuwa ya aho nk'hongo.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo amtalamkila Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Aho kize kibule Yelusalemu, wandugu wahuwila wa Kilisito wakihokelaga vedi vitendese. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Luvi yakwe Paulo aitaga na suwe kokumlamsa Yakobo, wadala vilongozi wose we idifyo dya wahuwila wa Kilisito wandaga aaho. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Weze wajike kuwalamsa, Paulo niyo awagambila yose yadamanywe ni Mnungu kwa want'hu hi Wayahudi kwa ndima adamanye. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Weze wajike kumtegeleza niyo wamtogolesa Mnungu. Niyo wamgamba Paulo, “Ndugu wadaha kuwona kugamba magana milongo magana ya Wayahudi wanda wahuwila naivo wakuitoza Imiko. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Nawagambilwa zimbuli zako kugamba noukawahiniziza Wayahudi wa kwikala kwe zi isi za want'hu hi Wayahudi, kugamba wase kukaula miko ya Musa, wasekuvinilwa wana wawe, naho wase kutimila vihendo va Kiyahudi. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Weva kindedi kugamba mpaka kale. Nekitende vivihi elo? <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Haluse utende enga ivi kikukulangiliza, aha kinanao want'hu wane waikile kilapi. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Timilana nao ao kwo mviko wo kukesunt'ha kumanya miko ya Mnungu, ukalihe maliho yakuungwa akajika wamogigwe zifili zawe, ivo want'hu wose nawamanye kugamba yadya wagambilwe mwa weye hayana kindedi chochose no kugamba weye mwenye ukei watimila miko ya Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Naho mwa wadya want'hu hi Wayahudi watendile wahuwilwa wa Kilisito, nekiwaandikile kale kuwagambila zimbuli kifanyanye, wasekudya chochose kitendelwe nt'hambiko kwe milungu ya kidant'hi, wase kunywa sakame wasekudya nyama inyogotolwe, naho mkenege no uhabwasi.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Ivo, zuwa ditimile Paulo awaguhaga wadya want'hu no kugenda kukesunt'ha hamwenga nawo, akajika niyo engila kwe Nyumba ya Mnungu, awagambilaga watu miwazile ya mazuwa yo kubinda ukukesunt'ha, naho niini malavo yakuunga yalavigwe kwajili ya kila yumwenga ywawe.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo avugailwa kwe Nyumba ya Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Mazuwa ayo mfungate yeze yande hagihi no kusila, Wayahudi walawaga mo mkowa wa Asia nawamuona Paulo kwe Nyumba ya Mnungu, niyo wasongeza maya kwe difyo dyose dya want'hu, no kumvugaila Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Wagutilaga wakagamba, “Want'hu wa Izilaeli, chambizeni! Uyu niyudya akugenda kila hant'hu, kuhiniza want'hu wose kuhigana na want'hu wa Isilaeli ne miko ya Musa ne Nyumba ya Mnungu, hata ivi haluse kawengiza kwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu want'hu hi Wayahudi, naho wahagela usavu hakukile ha Mnungu!” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Vilekile wakalonga ivo nikugamba wamuonaga Tolofimo mkaya wa Efeso akanda hamwenga na Paulo kwo mzi, niyo wafanyanya, Paulo nakamwingiza kudya kwe Nyumba ya Mnungu.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Mzi wose nowenela nk'humbizi, wezaga want'hu kulawa nt'hendelo zose, niyo wamgwila Paulo no kumbulumula, na kumlavila kuse ye Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, niyo aaho, nyivi ze Nyumba ya Mnungu zavugalagwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Waungaga wamkome Paulo, mna ulosi wabulaga kwo mkulu wa wank'hondo we Kilumi kugamba, Yelusalemu yose yamemaga nk'humbizi. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Aaho mkulu we difyo dye Kilumi aguhaga wank'hondo ne vilongozi wawe, niyo wawagulukila wadya want'hu, nawo weze wamuwone mkulu we difyo dye Kilumi, niyo waleka kumtoa Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Mkulu we difyo dye Kilumi amgulukilaga Paulo niyo amgwila no kusiigila Paulo akakilizwe mp'hingu mbili, akajika niyo auza, “Uyu niani? Naho kabalangai?” <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Mwedi fyo diya wamwenga nawakalonga ivi, wamwenga nawo walonga viya, kwe nk'humbizi iyo mkulu we difyo dya wank'hondo nakadunduga kumanya icho kilaile, ivo elo asigilaga awant'hu wakwe wamwigale Paulo kwe nk'hambi ya wank'hondo. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Paulo eze abule ho mhindo neviwaunga wank'hondo watekumwinula, kwe nk'humbizi ya want'hu. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Kwaviya fyo kulu dya want'hu dyandaga dika mtimila wakagamba, “Mkome, mkome.”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akegombela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Umwo yudya mkulu wa wank'hondo andile wakamwigala kwe divugailo, Paulo niyo amgamba, “Nadaha kukugambila kint'hu?” Yudya mkulu niyo amuuza, “Ha! Kumbeke kudaha kulonga Kigiliki”<verse eid="ACT 21:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />“Ivo weye hiyo yudya Mmisili, mwe mazuzi akongile kusaguka na kuwalongowela wadya makank'halu magana milongo mine mpaka kwenyika?”<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Paulo niyo ahitula, “Miye ni Myahudi, mwelekwa wa Taso uko Kilikia, mzi umanyikise. Nakulombeza vitendese nilonge na want'hu. <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Yudya mkulu wa wank'hondo niyo amwink'ha luneka, ivo Paulo akimaalaga mwo mhindo, niyo awahunga mkono wadya want'hu vileke wanyamale, naho weze wanyamale akongaga kulonga nao Kiibulania.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Wandugu zangu na watate, nitegelezeni, haluse nakegombela mwa meso yenyu!” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Weze weve akalonga nawo Kiibulania, niyo wanyamalisa kujink'ha hadya nk'hongo, Paulo niyo agendeela kulonga.<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Miye ni Myahudi mwelekwa wa Taso mwe Kilikia, mna nehileligwa aaha ho mzi wa Yelusalemu, kwa Mhinizi Gamalieli. Nehihinyizwa kindedi ndedi miko ya wakale wetu, nakelavaga kwa moyo wose kwa Mnungu, enga nyuwe wenye ivo mwili ivi dielo. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Nehiwasulumiza wadya want'hu watimile sila ino, nehiwakakiliza wavele kwa wagosi no kuwaduula kwedivugailo. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Mlava nt'hambiko mkulu no wadala vilongozi wose we kitala wadaha kulonga viya waione imbuli ino kulawa kwawe nahokelaga baluwa wawandikilagwa wadya Wahuwila Wekiyahudi, wadya wandile Damesiki, nehiita Damesiki vileke hawagwile want'hu awo no kuwegala mpaka Yelusalemu iviya wakakilizigwe, vileke wakasulumizwe.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo alonga ivo akombolwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Umwo nandaga haita, mwe sila hagihi na Damesiki, yandaga sa mtandatu nomsi, aaho ung'azi utendese kwo ulanga wanilailaga luholuho, niyo wawang'aila ndendelo zose. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Aha nagwaga hasi niyo neva izwi dikunigamba, ‘Sauli, Sauli! Nii wanisulumiza?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Name niyo nagamba, ‘Niwe ani Zumbe?’ Naye niyo anigamba, ‘Nimiye Yesu wa Nazaleti, uyo weye ukunisulumiza.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Wadya wambuyazangu wauonaga ung'azi udya, mna hawadivile diizwi dya yudya nalongaga naye. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Niyo nauza, ‘Zumbe nitende vivihi?’ Zumbe niyo anigamba, ‘Kimala, uite Damesiki, uko nuko nougambilwe yose ukuungwa udamanye.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Kwo ung'azi udya mkulu hyadahile kukaula ivo wadya wambuyazangu nawaungwa wanitoze mkono wanilongoele mpaka Damesiki.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />“Mwo mzi udya kwandaga na mnt'hu yumwenga zina dyakwe Anania, mnt'hu ywa Mnungu akutoza miko ya Musa, naho wayahudi wose wekalaga Damesiki walongaga uwona wedi mwa mnt'hu uyo. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Yehe ezaga kuniona, niyo akimaala hagihi na miye no kugamba, ‘Sauli! Ona kaidi!’ Aaho niyo nanda naona no kumkaula. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Anania niyo agamba, ‘Mnungu wa wakale wetu kakusagula umanye ivo akuunga, naho ummanye mtumwa ywakwe mkindedi no kumwiva yadya akulonga mwenye. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Kwaviya noulonge kwa want'hu yadya uyaone no kuyeva. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Haluse wagojai? Kimala ubatizwe naho uusilwe wavu wako, ulombeze mwe dizina dyakwe.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwitango lwa Paulo kuwabikiza want'hu hi Wayahudi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Nauyaga Yelusalemu, naho Umwo nandaga havika kwenyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu nehiona maona, <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />mwaayo namuonaga Zumbe akanigamba, ‘Sunguza naho uhalawe nguvu Yelusalemu, Kwaviya want'hu wa aha hawazumile uwona wako mwa miye.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Name niyo namhitula, ‘Zumbe, kunimanyisa vedi kugamba ni miye nandaga haita kwe zinyumba za Mnungu hawagwila no kuwatoa wose wandaga wakakuhuwila weye. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Naho umwo muwona ywako Sitefano akakomwa, miye nehinda aaho haona kukomwa kwakwe niyo nazumila kwamila zisuke za wadya wakomi.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Zumbe, Mnungu, niyo anigamba, ‘Ita, kwaviya nohwigalise hale kwa want'hu hi Wayahudi.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Wadya want'hu wamtegelezaga Paulo, mna eze alonge milosi iyo, wakongaga kugutila wakagamba, “Muuseni aha! Mkomeni! Mnt'hu enga uyo hawagilwe kulekwa mgima!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Wagendeelaga kutowa lwasu, uku wakakusula kusula makoti yawe, no kutimula luvumbi mwo ulanga kwa maya. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Mkulu we difyo dye Kiloma asigiilaga want'hu wakwe wamwigale Paulo kwe nk'hambi ya wank'hondo, no kuwagamba wamtoe Paulo mikotya vileke wamanye kilekile Wayahudi wakamtowela vugo. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Mna ize inde wamkakiliza kale vileke wamtowe mikotya, Paulo niyo awauza wakulu wadya wakimalaga hadya, “Togoleni mwe miko yadahika kumtowa mikotya mnt'hu ywa Lumi akanda akei kukantilwa?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Yudya mkulu eze eve ayo, niyo amuuza yudya mkulu we difyo dye Kilumi, “Watendai? Mnt'hu uyu Mloma!”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Yudya mkulu we difyo dye Kilumi, amwitilaga Paulo no kumuuza, “Nigambile, weye umwikazi ywa Loma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Paulo niyo ahitula, “Heiye,”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Yudya mkulu we wank'hondo niyo agamba, “Miye hinda mnt'hu ywa Loma kwa kuliha matundu yabindile wingi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Paulo niyo ahitula, “Miye ni Mloma ywa kwelekwa.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Wadya want'hu wakeikile lumwe kumuuza Paulo, wakeyagilizaga aaho no kuhalawa, hata yudya mkulu we difyo dye Kilumi niyo ogoha aho weze wabunk'hule kugamba Paulo ni Mloma mna naho wamkakiliza.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kwe kitala cha Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Mtondo wakwe, mkulu we difyo dye Kilumi, aungaga kumanya yadya yalekile Wayahudi wakamlongeleza, ivo amloholaga Paulo impingu yakwe niyo naho asigiila Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko ne kitala dyose wadugane, akajika amletaga Paulo niyo amkimalisa hameso ye kitala.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Paulo niyo awang'oela meso wadya Wadala we Kitala niyo agamba, “Wandugu zangu Wazilaeli! Mpaka dielo idi hinda na wikazi wa ukawiilo wedi hameso ya Mnungu.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Aho Mlava nt'hambiko Mkulu Anania niyo asigiila wadya wakimale hagihi naye Paulo wamtowe kofi mo mnomo. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Paulo niyo amgamba, “Yehe mwenye Mnungu naakutowe kofi weye mtondwe! Togola wadaha vivihi kwikala aho vileke unisengele kutimila miko, mna weye mwenye wi mwavu we miko kwa kuwatuma wanitowe!”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Want'hu wadya wakimalaga hadya niyo wamgamba Paulo, “Weye wamhomola Mlava nt'hambiko Mkulu ywa Mnungu!”<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Paulo niyo ahitula, “Wandugu zangu, Wazilaeli, miye himanyize kugamba yehe ni Mlava nt'hambiko Mkulu, kwaviya Mawandiko Akukile wagamba, ‘Usekulonga yaihile kwo mkulu ywa want'hu wako.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Paulo eze amanye kugamba wamwenga mwa want'hu wekitala wandaga Masadukayo, wamwenga nao Wafalisayo, ivo niyo alonga kwa izwi kulu akagamba, “Wandugu zangu miye ni Mfalisayo mwana Mfalisayo, higalwa hekitala kwaviya nakawiila kugamba wabanike nawauyuke!”<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Eze alonge ayo, niyo kwa laila vugo kulu mwa Wafalisayo na Wasadukayo, niyo mdugano wake panga haidi. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Mbuli iyenye ni kugamba, Masadukayo wagamba wabanike hawakuuyuka, hahali mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu, hegu muye ukugela ugima nazo haukuli, mna Wafalisayo wayazumila ayo yose matatu. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Vugo dyagendeelaga vitendese, nawamwenga mwa wahinizi we miko kafyo kakwe Mafalisayo nawakimala no kuhiga kwa nguvu wakagamba, “Hakikuona wavu wowose mwo mnt'hu uyu! Yadahika kugamba ni muye ywa ugima hegu mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu kalonga naye!”<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Vugo niyo dyongezekela hata mkulu we difyo dye Kilumi engilwa ni woga kugamba wadaha kumlatula Paulo vibesu besu, ivo niyo awasigiila wadya wank'hondo wakwe wamguhe Paulo no ku mwingiza kundani kwe nk'hambi ya wank'hondo.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Kilo kiya, Zumbe akimaalaga hagihi na Paulo niyo amgamba, “Usekogoha! Kwinkwa kuwagambila mbuli zangu want'hu wa Yelusalemu, waungwa utende iivo uko Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi waunga wamkome Paulo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Kwize kuche, Wayahudi wekalaga hamwenga kwa kinyele, niyo waika kilapi kugamba, hawadye hegu kunywa mpaka aho nawande wamkoma kale Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Want'hu wajink'hile milongo mine waikaga kilapi kwa hamwenga. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Waitaga kwa wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na wadala vilongozi, no kugamba, “Suwe kiika kilapi cha hamwenga kugamba, hekilume no kudya chochose mpaka aho nekinde kimkoma Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Haluse elo, nyuwe hamwenga ne kitala tumeni want'hu kwo mkulu ywe difyo dye Kilumi vileke amwigale Paulo kwenyu mkakezige kugamba mwaunga mpate ikindedi mwa yehe. Mna nekikeike lumwe kumkoma hata uneva akei mpaka hagihi.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Mna mhwawe dya Paulo nakeva umzungu uwo, ivo aitaga kundani kwe digomela no kumgambila Paulo imbuli iyo. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Paulo amwitangaga mkulu yumwenga mwa wank'hondo, niyo amgamba, “Mwigaleni ndugu ywetu uyo kwo mkulu we difyo dye Kilumi, ana kint'hu cha kumgambila.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Mkulu uyo amguhaga uyo ndugu ywetu niyo amwigala mpaka kwo mkulu we difyo dye Kilumi, yudya mnk'hondo niyo amgamba, “Yudya mvugailwa Paulo nakanitanga niyo anituma nimlete uyu ndugu ywetu kwako, kwaviya ana dya kukugambila.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Yudya mkulu we difyo dye Kilumi, amtozaga mkono nokumwigala haheina want'hu niyo amuuza, “Una kint'hu chani cha kunigambila?”<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Yehe niyo agamba, “Wayahudi waivana wakulombeze umwigale Paulo kwe kitala wakakeziga kugamba, kitala chaunga kive ikindedi kulawa kwakwe. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Mna weye usekuzumila kwaviya weyuko want'hu wajink'hile milongo mine wakefisile wakamgoja kumnk'hupukila. Waika kilapi kugamba hawadye no kunywa chochose, mpaka wamkome. Haluse wakeika lumwe kutenda ivo, elo wagoja ulamuzi wako.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Mkulu we difyo dye Kilumi niyo amleka aite, mna nakamkanya akamgamba, “Use kumgambila yoyose kugamba kwiza kunink'ha lwazi.” Niyo amleka yudya ndugu ywetu aite.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo egalwa ko Mkulu Mkoa Felikisi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Basi mkulu we difyo dye Kilumi awetangaga wank'hondo waidi niyo awagamba, “Ikeni lumwe wank'hondo magana maidi, wezi falasi milongo mfungate, na watuhu magana maidi wande ne mijungo waite Kaisalia, mkeike lumwe kwinuka hainati mpaka sant'hatu kilo cha dielo. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Ikeni falasi zimwenga kwajili ya Paulo, mbuzeni kwa vedi kwa Felikisi mkulu we Kilumi mwe isi ya Uyahudi.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Mkulu uyo wedifyo dye Kilumi nakawandika baluwa ikugamba.<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Miye Kilaudia Lusia nakuwandikila weye zumbe Felikisi Mkulu we Kilumi mwe isi ya Uyahudi. Nakulamsa! <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Wayahudi nawamgwila uyu mnt'hu naho waunga wamkome. Nehibunk'hula kugamba mnt'hu uyo ni Mlumi na ivo niyo naita na wank'hondo wangu kwo kumkombola. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Nehimwigala kwe kitala chawe kikulu hazungula kumanya kilekile wakamlongeleza. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Nehibunk'hula kugamba, malongelezo yenye nayanda mwe kuhigana mwe zimbuli ze miko yawe, hiyone kugamba kabananga chochose kimuwagile avugailwe kwe divugailo hegu kukomwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Nize nigambilwe kugamba Wayahudi waunga wamkome nehiona vedi nimwigale kwako, niyo nawagamba walongelezi wakwe wakwigaile malongelezo yawe kwako.” <verse eid="ACT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Basi wadya wank'hondo nawamwigala Paulo enga ivo wagambigwe, no kumwigala kilo iikiya mpaka kwo mzi wa Antipati. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Zuwa ditimile wank'hondo we viga nawauya kwe digomela no kuwaleka wadya wank'hondo we zifalasi wagendeele no utafi hamwenga na Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Weze wabulaga Kaisalia, wamwink'haga mkulu wo mkoa ibaluwa idya no kumwink'hiza Paulo mwe mikono yakwe. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Felikisi eze aisome ibaluwa, amuuzaga Paulo kugamba kulawa mkoa uhi? Eze agambilwe kugamba kalawa mkoa wa Kilikia, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />niyo agamba, “Nenitegeleze masa yako aho walongelezi wako wanabula.” Niho akisigiila Paulo aikwe mo ukaulwa mndani mo ukumbi wo mkulu wo mkowa etangwe Helode.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Wayahudi wamlongeleza Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Yeze yomboke mazuwa mashano, Anania Mlava nt'hambiko Mkulu abulaga Kaisalia akanda hamwenga na wadala vilongozi wamwenga no mkimaila mbuli akwitangwa Tetulo, nawamwitila yudya mkulu wo mkoa niyo wamgambila malongelezo yawe mwa Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Paulo naketangwa, Tetulo niyo akonga malongelezo enga ivi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">“Zumbe Felikisi, ulongozi wako wedi ukigaila utondowazi mkulu no kugolola kukuungwa mkukigala uwedi kwetu. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Chaihokela imbuli ino kwa kinyemi mazuwa yose na kulava ukulu zitendese hohose kwako. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Mna haheina kwaza lupisi chakulombeza utegeleze ulosi wetu mguhi. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Kibunk'hula kugamba mnt'hu uyu nk'hondo itendese, yehe ni nk'hongelo ya nk'humbizi mwa Wayahudi hant'hu hohose mwe isi naho ni kilongozi wo umwenga wa Wanazaleti. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Naho nakageza kuilonga vihile inyumba yo kuvikila, niyo suwe chamgwila. Nekikaunga kimsengele viligane ne miko yetu. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Ivo Lusia mkulu we difyo dye Kilumi kwa nk'humbizi nk'hulu niyo akihoka mnt'hu uyo kulawa kwetu. Asigiilaga walongelezi wa Paulo weze kwako, <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Mneva unamlaha, wadaha ukabunk'hula zimbuli izi zose kikumlongelezela.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Wayahudi wayagwaga mgongo malongelezo ayo yose wakagamba, yose ayo na yanda ni kindedi.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akegombela mwa meso ya Felikisi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Mkulu wa Uyahudi Filikisi niyo amwink'ha Paulo kilagiso vileke alonge, Paulo niyo agamba,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:10">“Himanya kugamba kunda mlamuzi mwe ditaifa idi kwa myaka mingi, naivo nna kinyemi kukegombela mwa meso yako. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Wadaha kunda ne kindedi kugamba hayakujink'ha mazuwa mlongo na maidi yomboke, kukongela hadya naitile Yelusalemu kugenda kuvika. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Wayahudi hawanione halafya na mnt'hu yeyose, hawanibwiile hawasongeza want'hu kwe Nyumba za kuvikila, hegu mwe zinyumba za Mnungu, hegu hant'hu hatuhu hohose mwo mzi uwo. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Naho hawakudaha kulavanya malongelezo yawe kwangu. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Kint'hu huzumila mwa meso yako ni kugamba, miye na mvika Mnungu wakale wetu kwa kutimila Sila idya woho wakuigamba lulimi, Mna naho nahuwila mbuli zose ziwandikwe mwe vitabu ve miko ya Musa, hamwenga na walotezi wa Mnungu. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Nna makawiilo kwa Mnungu, ayadya woho nawo wakukukawiila kugamba want'hu wedi na waihile nawauyuke. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Kwa ivo nakombeka mazuwa yose kunda na moyo wedi mwa meso ya Mnungu na want'hu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />“Nize nikale hale na Yelusalemu kwa mazuwa mengi, nehiita uuko Yelusalemu kugenda kuguha matundu kwa wandugu zangu vileke niwegaile wambuyazangu wambizi na kulava malavo. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Umwo nandile hadamanya ayo niho wanibwiilaga kwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, naho nehinda hidamanya kale mviko wo kukesunt'ha hakwandile na fyo dya want'hu hegu nk'humbizi yoyose. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Mna nokunda na Wayahudi wamwenga kulawa kwe isi ya Asia ndodo, awo nawo wawagilwe kunda mwa meso yako dielo aha, no kulonga malongelezo yawe uneva wananayo yoyose yo kulonga mwa miye. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Hegu du waleke awa weyaha walonge wiihi uwo waone umwo nakimale hameso ye kitala chawe, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />uneva hiyo ino du milosi nilongile Umwo nakimale hameso yawe, ‘mwanisengela dielo kwaviya hitozeleza ulosi wa kugamba wabanike nawauyuke.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Aho Felikisi yudya adimanyaga vedi difyo dya wamhuwile Yesu Kilisito nakawagamba, “Nenilave fanyanyi mwa masa aya aho neezile Lusia, Mkulu we difyo dye Kilumi.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Felikisi amgambaga yudya mkulu we difyo dya wank'hondo, Paulo amilwe mna ande no vilekelwa ludodo, naho wambuyaze wasekufingizwa kumwink'ha vint'hu mo uungi wakwe.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo hameso ya Felikisi na Dulusila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Yeze yomboke mazuwa mageke, Felikisi nakabula hamwenga na mkaziwe Dulusila, uyo andaga Myahudi. Aungaga Paulo egalwe kwakwe, amtegeleze ivo akulonga naivo akumhuwila Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Mna Paulo Umwo andaga akagendeela kulonga mbuli yo kumwelela, na kukefingiza, ne dizuwa dyo Usengelo, Felikisi nakogoha niyo agamba, “Kwa haluse wadaha kuita nenize hwitange naho heza kupata luneka,” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Aaho naaka kawiila kugamba Paulo naamfumbase matundu, valeka naaka mwitanga itanga Paulo nokusimuila nae.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Ize yomboke myaka miidi Pokio Fesito na kuguha ukulu hant'hu ha Felikisi. Kwaviya Felikisi aungaga kuwadamanyila Wayahudi uwedi, amwasaga Paulo kwe divugailo.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Paulo ahimbiluka kwa zumbe Mkulu we Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Yeze yomboke mazuwa matatu, Fesito abulaga mwo mkoa wakwe, alawaga Kaisalia kuita Yelusalemu, <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />uko wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na vilongozi wa Wayahudi wegalaga malongelezo yawe mwa Paulo. Nawamlombeza Fesito <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Awadamanyile mbuli yedi ya kumwigala Paulo uko Yelusalemu, kwaviya nawaunga mzungu wakumkomela Paulo mwe sila. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Fesito awahitulaga, “Paulo kavugailwa uko Kaisalia, name neniuye uuko nguvu. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Gojeni niitanyene vilongozi wenyu wakamlongeleze uko uneva ana idyo abanange.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Fesito ekalaga nao kwa mazuwa mnane hegu mlongo, niyo aita Kaisalia. Mwedizuwa ditimile, Fesito ekalaga hedifumbi che kitala no kusigiila Paulo egalwe kwakwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Paulo eze abule, Wayahudi walawile Yelusalemu wakimalaga wakanda wamzunguluka no kukonga kulava malongelezo yabindile ingi hewedahile kuya lavila uwona wakwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Mna Paulo akegombelaga akagamba, “Miye hitendile dyodyose diihile dya kuhiga miko ya Wayahudi, hegu kuhiga Nyumba yo kuvika, hegu kuuhiga Seuta ywa Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Mna Fesito nakaunga kuwadamanyila uwedi Wayahudi, ivo niyo amuuza Paulo, “Waunga hwigale Yelusalemu vileke ukasengelwe uko mwa meso yangu, mwa malongelezo aya?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Paulo niyo ahitula, “Nakakimala hameso ye kitala cha Seuta ywa Kilumi, Ivo hiwagilwa kwinkwa usengelo aaha. Hiwadamanyile Wayahudi wiihi wowose wemwenye kumanya vedi. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Mna uneva hibananga miko ya kuniunga kukomwa, hikulombeza kuusilwa usengelo uwo, Mna uneva hakihali kindedi mwa malongelezo yawe ayo wayalongile, hahali akudaha kunink'hiza kwawe, Nalombeza kuhimbiluka kwa Seuta ywe Kilumi.”<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Fesito, eze dione hamwenga na walangilizi wakwe, nakamgamba Paulo, “Kukant'ha Lufani kwa Seuta ywe Kilumi, vedi, nowigalwe kwa Seuta ywe Kilumi.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo hameso ya Agilipa na Belinike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Mazuwa mageke kulongole, Zumbe Agilipa na Benike wabulaga Kaisalia kumnamsa Fesito Seuta ywe Kilumi. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Wandaga uuko mazuwa mengi, Fesito niyo amgambila Zumbe amasa ya Paulo, “Eyaha mnt'hu yumwenga atozelezagwa ni Felikisi. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Nize niite Yelusalemu, Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko, na wadala vilongozi wa Wayahudi, nawamlongeleza, niyo wanilombeza amgele Paulo mwa masa asulumizwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Mna miye nehiwahitula kugamba hiyo kihendo cha Walumi kumlava mnt'hu asulumizwe uneva akei kulongelezwa no kudugana na walongelezi wakwe, no kwink'higwa luneka lwa kukegombela mwa yadya alongelezwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Elo weze wabule aha nehisunguza naho luvi yakwe nehitanga kitala, niyo nasigiila kugamba mnt'hu uyo egalwe aha. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Walongelezi wakwe wakimalaga, mna hawadahaga kulonga mbuli yoyose iihile mwa Paulo enga ivo nehakawiila. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Nahanda du na mahigano na yehe mwe mbuli yo kuvika kwawe, ivo wakuhuwila mwa mnt'hu yumwenga abanikaga, akwitangwa Yesu, mna Paulo yehe agamba mnt'hu uyu emgima hata ivi. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Hione dyo kudamanya mwe imbuli ino, ivo nehimuuza Paulo uneva naakaunga kuita Yelusalemu vileke akauzwe uko mwa malongelezo ayo. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Mna Paulo niyo ahimbiluka, alombezaga kutozelezwa na kumlekela mkulu we Kiloma aifanyanye imbuli ino, naivo niyo nasigiila atozelezwe mpaka aho nenimwigale kwa mkulu wa Kiloma.” <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Agilipa niyo amgamba Fesito, “Nehaunga nimtegeleze umnt'hu uyu miye mwenye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Fesito niyo amhitula, “Nomtegeleze luvi,”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Ivo luvi yakwe, Agilipa na Benike wabulaga kwa kwanga hekitala hamwenga na wakulu wa mafyo ya wank'hondo ne vilongozi wo mzi, Fesito niyo agamba Paulo engizwe kundani kwe kitala. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Fesito niyo agamba, “Zumbe Agilipa hamwenga na wose mwiaha hamwenga nasuwe, Mwamuona mnt'hu akuwahiga Wayahudi wose waaha na wadya wa Yelusalemu, wamwigala kwangu kwa kulabila. Wagutilalaga wakagamba hawagilwe kunda mgima. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Mna miye hione kugamba nakabalanga dyodyose mpaka asengelwe kukomwa, mna Kwaviya mwenye Paulo nakahimbiluka kwa mkulu wa Kiloma, niyo nasigiila egalwe Loma. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Kwa miye hina ulosi we kindedi uwo hudaha kumwandikila mkulu wa Kiloma mwa Paulo, nivo vikuleka himleta aha hameso yenyu na Zumbe Agilipa, vileke habinda kupelemba ninde na dyo kulonga. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Kwaviya nevigele seko kumwigala mvugailwa haheina kuyalonga malongelezo yakumgweela.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Paulo akegombela hameso ya Agilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Zumbe Agilipa amgambaga Paulo, “Kwink'higwa luneka lwa kukegombela.” Aho Paulo na kuchulula mkono wakwe akakegombela saivi. <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Zumbe Agilipa! Nakeona kunda mta masa, dielo kukegombela hameso yako mwa malongelezo yose yalongigwe ni Wayahudi mwa miye, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />vitendese kwaviya weye mwenye ummanyi we vihendo va Wayahudi hamwenga nezimbuli hewekuivana, ivo nakulombeza unitegeleze kwa kufinyiliza.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Wayahudi waumanya wikazi wangu kulawa udodo, ivo nekale kukongela nk'hongo mwe isi yangu na Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Wammanya Lupisi lutali, uneva nawadahe wakalonga uwona wawe mwa miye uneva wakaunga, kugamba kukongela nk'hongo nehikala enga yumwenga mwa kafyo chandile na siasa nk'hali, wakwitangwa Wafalisayo. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Haluse niyaha nisengelwe kwaviya nakawiila lagano Mnungu awenk'haga wakale wetu, <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />ino niyo indagano idya ikukawiilwa na wakale wetu, wakamvika Mnungu msi na kilo. Zumbe dyangu, aya nayo yakuleka Wayahudi wakanilongeleza. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Nii mwaona vihile kuhuwila kugamba Mnungu auyula want'hu wabanike?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />“Miye mwenye nehifanyanya kugamba nehaungwa kudamanya mbuli yoyose ya kuwahiga want'hu wakudihuwila dizina dya Yesu ywa Nazaleti. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Mbuli izo nizo nidamanye uko Yelusalemu, miye mwenye handa hink'higwa udahi ni wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko, nawavugailaga kwe divugailo want'hu wengi wa Mnungu, naho wakasengelwa kukomwa, nehigwa mgongo kuzumila kukomwa kwawe. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Nkanana nyingi nehiwatenda wasulumizwe mwezi nyumba zawe za Mnungu, nokuwatigiza wa ulemele mhuwi wawe. Nandilisaga na maya mwa woho niyo nawazungula mpaka kwe mizi ya hale.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo alonga ivo akomboke.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Ivi nivo valekaga haita Damesiki handa hink'higwa udahi na miko ni wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Zumbe, Umwo nandaga mwe sila, msi wa gati, naonaga ung'azi ukujink'ha ung'azi wedizuwa, kulawa kulanga, niyo wanizunguluka miye na watafi wambuyazangu. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Suwe chose chagwaga hasi, miye nevaga izwi dikunitanga kwa Kiibulania, ‘Sauli, Sauli, nii wanisulumiza? Wekelumiza bule enga mp'hunda ikutoa mazela ingoda ya zumbe ywakwe.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Miye namuuzaga, ‘Weye ni weye ani Zumbe?’ Yesu niyo ahitula, ‘Nimiye Yesu uyo weye ukunisulumiza. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Mna haluse inuka, naho Kimala, hikulaila vileke hutende mtumwa ywangu, no uwalavile uwona watuhu zimbuli ziya uzione kwangu dielo, na yadya yakwiza kulongole nayo no hulagise. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />No hwamile mwa want'hu wa Izilaeli naho nohwamile mwa watuhu hi Waizilaeli wadya huunga hutume kwawe. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Nouwenk'he kumanya, no kuwalava mo uhezi mwo udahi wa Mwavu, wamhitukile Mnungu vileke kwa kuhuwila wapate kuusilwa wavu wawe no kuhokela hant'hu hawe, mgati mwa wadya wasagulwe kunda want'hu wa Mnungu.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo atambalisa indima yakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Na ivo, zumbe Agilipa, hidunduga kuzilemela mbuli za kulanga nilagiswe. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Nk'hongo mwe Damesiki, na mwe Yelusalemu naho akajika mwo Uyahudi yose na mwa want'hu wamwenga hi Wayahudi, Nehiwabilikiza waleke wavu wawe, wamuuie Mnungu, no kulagisa kwa udamanyi kugamba wakeiila wavu wawe. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Kwa ayo Wayahudi wanigwilaga Umwo nandile kwe Nyumba ya Mnungu, niyo wageza kunikoma. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Mna Mnungu kanambiza mpaka mwedizuwa dya dielo, naho hikimala nitogile halava uwona wangu kwa wose, kwa wakulu, na wadodo. Hina dya kulonga mwa yadya yalongagwa ni Walotezi na Musa kugamba nayalaile. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Wakagamba, neviungwa Kilisito Mkombozi kusulumizwa no kunda wa nk'hongo kuuyuka kwa wabanike, kubwelekeza ung'azi wo ukombola kwa Wayahudi na want'hu wose.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Paulo eze abule aho mo kukegombela, Fesito niyo amkwank'hila kwa izwi kulu, “Paulo umkilalu! Kuhinisa kwako kwa kugela kilalu!”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Mna Paulo niyo agamba, “Zumbe Fesito, miye hiyo mkilalu, kiya hulonga ni kindedi kihala. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Zumbe, weye kuyamanya aya, kwa ivo na mwadaha kulonga haheina kogoha. Nna ikindedi kugamba aya yalaile yamanyika kwako, kwaviya mbuli izi hazidamanywe kifiso. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Togola zumbe Agilipa, weye una mhuwi na Walotezi? Himanya kugamba una mhuwi”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agilipa niyo amhitula Paulo, “Kwa lupisi luguhi ulu nounitende kunda mhuwila ywa Kilisito?”<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Paulo niyo ahitula kugamba namlombeza Mnungu, “Kwa lupisi luguhi hegu lutali, hiyo weye du, mna wose wakuniva dielo wadahe kunda enga ivo miye nili mna hiyo kwa mp'hingu izi!”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Aho niyo zumbe, mkulu wo mkoa, na Benike na wadya watuhu wose wandile hamwenga nawo nawakimala. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Weze wahalawe niyo wagambana, “Mnt'hu uyu habanange dyodyose diwagile usengelo wa kukomwa hegu kugenda kuvugailwa kwe divugailo.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Agilipa naye niyo amgamba Fesito, “Mnt'hu uyu hegu nakalekelwa wandile hahimbiluke kwo mkulu wa Kiloma.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Utafi wa Paulo kuita Loma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Weze kibule mo ulamuzi wo kuita Italia nawamuiika Paulo na wafungwa weyawe watuhu mo wamizi wa Yulio, mkulu we difyo dya watowani dye Kilumi dikwitangwa “Fyo dya Augusito.” <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Chakwelaga ngalawa ya Adilamito yandaga ikatamba no kombokela kwe zibandali zo mkoa wa Asia, niyo chakonga utafi. Alistaliko mkaya ywa Makedonia alaile Sesalonike, andaga hamwenga na suwe. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Luvi yakwe chaikaga nt'hulwe mwe bandali ya Sidoni. Yulio amtendelaga vedi Paulo kwa kumleka awaone wambuyaze vileke enk'hwe yadya andaga akayaunga. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Kulawa uko nekigendeela, mna kwaviya nk'hung'unto neikakihingamila kwa nguvu, chombokelaga kwe nt'hendelo int'huhu ye kisiwa cha Kipulo. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Niyo chajink'hanya Ibahali ya Kilikia ne ye Pamfilia niyo chaika nt'hulwe aho Mula mzi wa Lukia. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Yudya mkulu niyo abwiila ngalawa ya Alekizandilia yandaga ikaita Italia niyo akikweza uumo.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Kwa mazuwa mengi chagendaga mp'halahole, naho kwa udala utendese chabulaga hagihi na Nido, kwaviya ink'hung'unto yandaga ika kihingamila kisekugendeela mwe nt'hendelo idya, nekiseela nokombokela nt'hendelo ya Kilete hagihi ne isi nk'havu ya Salimoni ingile mwe bahali, kwandaga hekwiina nk'hung'unto nk'hulu. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Nechombokela mnk'handa mwakwe mp'halahole niyo chabula hant'hu hakwitangwa, Bandali Yedi hagihi no mzi wa Lasea.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Kiguha mazuwa mengi, mpaka yanda hatali kugendela mwa mazi kwaviya dizuwa dyo kuvina wila wo kufunga dyandaga dyomboka. Ivo Paulo niyo awakanya. <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Wagosi, naona enga utafi uno nounde mdala naho nowaze ugoli ne ngalawa, hamwenga no ugima.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Mna yudya mkulu na keleleswa ne zifanyanyi za mgendeza ngalawa na za mta ingalawa kuzileka zifanyanyi za Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Kwaviya bandali iyo hayandile ni hant'hu hedi hokwikala mwo lupisi we mp'heho, wengi waungisaga kugendeela no utafi, ikadahika wabule Foenike, Foenike ni bandali ya Kilete ikuhinga kwa mwenye mzi yo usweelo wa zuwa, na Kusini ulailo wa zuwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kung'unto kulu mwe bahali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Basi mp'heho yedi ya kusini niyo yakonga kuvuguta, woho nawakagamba napate makawiilo yawe, ivo niyo wausa chuma kizamile kikutozeleza ingalawa no kugendeza ingalawa yawe hagihi vitendese ne mp'wani ya Kilete. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Mna halwomboke lupisi, nk'hung'unto nk'hulu ikwitangwa nk'hung'unto ya “Kwa mwenye mzi” yakongaga kuvuguta kulawa kwe kisiwa no kuisindikila ingalawa kwe bahali. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Nkung'unto neitoa ingalawa, naho kwaviya hachadahile kuhigana nayo chailekaga ingalawa isukumizwe ni ink'hung'nto iyo. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Nekipata nk'hinga aho kize chombokele kusini ye kasiwa kamwenga kakwitangwa Kauda. Hadya handaga na udala, naivi nekiungwa kuuhonya mtumbwi we ngalawa. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Nawauvuta udya mtumbwi kundani niyo wazinganiza sigi idya ingalawa no kuikakiliza, nawogoha kugamba nawakadaha kukwama kudya kwo uheelo we bahali, mp'wani yafilika ya kwa mwenye mzi uko Libia, ivo nawaseleza disuke dye ingalawa no kuileka ingalawa iguhigwe ni nk'hung'unto. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Mjubwaniko nougendeela niyo luvi yakwe wakonga kuduula kuse imizigo yandile mwe ngalawa <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />naho mwedizuwa dya katatu nawakonga kuuduula vidamanyilo ve ngalawa mwa mazi. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Kwa mazuwa mengi hakione zuwa hegu nt'hondo no mjubwaniso wagendeelesaga, makawiilo yo ugima wetu nayaga. <verse eid="ACT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Weze wekale mazuwa mengi haheina kudya nk'hande, Paulo akimaalaga hagati yawe na kugamba, “Wagosi! Nevinda vedi mwanitegeleze, no kuleka kutamba kulawa Kilete, hegu nekihona na ubanangi nowagilizi uno wose. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Mna haluse nawalombezani keink'heni moyo, hahali hata yumwenga akuunga aze ugima wakwe ingalawa du niyo niyage. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Kwaviya gulo nekilo Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu ywa Mnungu ywangu naho uyo Mnungu humvika, nakaniizila <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu niyo anigamba, ‘Paulo usekogoha, waungwa kukimala hameso ha zumbe Seuta ywe Kilumi, naho kwajili ya wenye Mnungu naawakombole wadya wose ukutambanya nawo mwe ngalawa wasekwangamila.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Ivo mazumbe keink'heni moyo! Kwaviya nahuwila Mnungu kugamba nevinde ivo nigambilwe. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Mna chaungwa kiduulwe kwe kisiwa kimwenga.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Kilo cha zuwa dya mlongo na kane, nekika jubwaniswa ni nk'hung'unto uku na uku mwe bahali ya Meditelaniani. Mwe kilogati, wogelezi waonaga enga chandaga hagihi ne isi nk'havu. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Ivo nawakazungula utali we ibahali kwa kuseleza luzigi lwa fundikagwa kint'hu kizamile, niyo wapata utali wa mikono milongo mine kuita hasi niyo wahima kaidi, no kupata mikono milongo mitatu. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Kwa kogoha kukwama mwe zinyuwe, nawaseleza machuma mane yazamile yakutoza ingalawa kunyuma ye ngalawa, uku wakalombeza kusunguze kucha. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Wogelezi waungaga kunyilika naho nawaseleza kale umtumbwi mwa mazi wakakeziga kugamba wagenda kuseleza chuma kizamile kikutoza ingalawa ye ngalawa nt'hendelo ya kulongole ye ngalawa. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Mna Paulo niyo amgamba yudya mkulu we difyo dye Kilumi na wank'hondo wakwe, “Uneva wogelezi hawana sigale umwo mndani mwe ngalawa, homkauile kuhona” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Aho wadya wank'hondo niyo wazisenga ziya zisigi zandile zitoza idya ingalawa indodo, niyo wauleka ukubigwe na mazi.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Aho kukaunga kuche, Paulo awatigizaga wose wadye nk'hande, “Kwa mazuwa mlongo na mane mwa mashaka naho haheina kudya chochose. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Elo nawalombezani mdye nk'hande niho mgendeele no ugima, kwaviya hata luvili lumwenga kwe mitwi yenyu holwage.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Eze ajink'he kulonga ivo, Paulo aguhaga mkate na kuubendula na kumtogola Mnungu hameso yawe no kukonga kudya. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Aho wose niyo wapata moyo wo kudya nk'hande niyo nao wadya. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Kwa hamwenga chandaga mwe ngalawa iyo, want'hu magana maidi na milongo mfungate na waidi. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Kila yumwenga eze adye mkate no kwiguta nawahungula kuzama kwe ngalawa kwa kuiduula ink'hande mwe bahali.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubogozoka kwe ingalawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Kwize kuche wogelezi hawadahile kuikombaganya isi idya, ila nawaona bahali ndodo ingile mwe isi nk'havu yo msanga, niyo wafanyanya kugamba hegu vadahike nawaika nt'hulwe uuko. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Ivo niyo wakant'ha machuma kizamile kikuitoza ingalawa nakuzileka mwe bahali, aaho nawazifungula zisigi zandile zikikaka kilongozela. Niyo watungika disuke dye ngalawa kulongole vileke ink'hung'unto iisukumize ingalawa kulongole no kuhamila mwo msanga we bahali. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Mna wabula hamwenga hadugane bahali mbili, ngalawa niyo yakwama, kwa kulongole neididimila mwo msanga, haheina kusingisika, kwa kunyuma nako nokukonga kubogozoka mabasi basi, kwajili yo mjubwaniso wa mazi.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Wank'hondo waungaga kuwa koma wavugailwa wose kwakogoha kugamba wavugailwa ao nawakadaha kogeela mpaka ng'ambu niyo wanyilika. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Mna Kwaviya yudya mkulu we difyo dye Kilumi naakaunga amhonye Paulo nakawafingiza wasekutenda ivo, nakawalekela wadya wadahile kogeela wapilike kulawa mwe ngalawa no kogeela mpaka ng'ambu <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />wamwenga wakaketozela mwa mabasi ye ngalawa ibogozoke. Ivi nivo wose kibuile ng'ambu kwa vedi.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Paulo uko Malita.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Kize kibule vedi mwe isi nk'havu, nekibunk'hula kugamba kisiwa kiya nekiketangwa Malita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Wakaya wa aho wandaga wedi vitendese kwetu fula neikakonga kunya naho nokukalosa, ivo niyo wagima moto na kukitanga. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Paulo alogotaga kazilo kadodo kakwe nk'huni niyo azigeela mo moto, aaho kwajili ye kizihuye cho moto, niyo kwa laila nyoka mwe zink'huni na kumluma Paulo mwo mkono nokung'ang'anila ahadya. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Wakaya wa hadya weze waione idya inyoka yaning'inila mwo mkono wakwe niyo wagamba, “Kindedi mnt'hu uyu kakoma, hamwenga na kugamba kayokolwa kulawa mwe kubanika mwe bahali, kuzumilwa kunda ywedi ha meso ha Mnungu hokumleke agendeele kunda mgima.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Mna Paulo nakaikung'unt'hila momoto idya inyoka naho halumizwe hohose. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Wadya want'hu nawakakawiila kugamba hegu nakalulumka, naho hegu nakagwa na kubanika aaho. Mna weze wagojele kwa lupisi lutali, haheina kuwona kugamba Paulo kapatigwa ni mbuli yoyose iihile, nawahitula zifanyanyi zawe mwa yehe na kugamba, “Yehe mnungu!”<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Handaga hiho hale na hant'hu hadya handaga ne migunda ya Pubilio, mkulu we kisiwa kiya. Pubilio Akihokelaga kwa kise, no kunda wageni wakwe kwa mazuwa matatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Ise dya Pubilio andaga mnyonge wa molusazi, mnyonge wa misango ya kuhala, Paulo nakagenda kumuwona, eze abinde kuvika Mnungu agelekaga mikono mo mnyonge no kumhonya. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Kwa kulaila idyo, wanyonge wose mwe kisiwa kiya naweza na kuhonyigwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Want'hu wakink'haga mageleko, naho kize kikonge naho utafi nawagela mwe ngalawa vint'hu vingi kikuviunga mwe nt'hambo.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utafi kulawa Malita kuita Loma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Ize yomboke miyezi mitatu, nekikonga naho utafi wetu mwe ngalawa imwenga ya Alekizandilia, ikwitangwa “Milungu Mapasa”, ngalawa iyo yaikaga nt'hulwe hekisiwa mo msimo wose we mp'heho. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Nekibula mo mzi wa Silakusa, no kwikala aho mazuwa matatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Kulawa uko nekikonga utafi na kuzunguluka no mpaka mo mzi Legio. Dize dyomboke zuwa dimwenga ink'hung'unto neikonga kuvuguta kulawa kusini, naho yeze yomboke mazuwa maidi nekibula kwe bahali ya Potioli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Uko chawabwiilagwa wandugu wahuwila wengi wakilombezaga kikale nao kwa juma dimwenga. Naivo nekibula Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Wahuwila wa kudya Loma weze weve zimbuli zetu, naweza kukihokela hant'hu ha gwilo dya Apio na nyumba nt'hatu, Paulo eze awaone, nakamtogola Mnungu no kupata nguvu.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo mo mzi wa Loma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Kize kibule Loma Paulo nakalekwa kwikala ekedu kedu hamwenga na mnk'hondo kumwamila.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Mazuwa matatu yeze yomboke Paulo awetangaga wakulu we Kiyahudi wa hant'hu aho weze waduganyike, Paulo niyo awaganba, “Waizilaeli wambuyazangu, hata uneva miye hidamanye chochose kiihile hekikuzumilana na want'huwetu hegu vihendo viya kihokele kulawa kwa wakale wetu, nehitendigwa kunda mvugailwa kudya Yelusalemu no kwink'hizwa kwa Walumi. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Weze waniuze no kuwona kugamba hyandile na masa yoyose, nawaunga kunilekela. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Mna Wayahudi wamwenga nawalemela imbuli iyo, name niyo yaniunga kukant'ha lufani kwa Seuta ywa Kilumi, hata uneva hyandile na cha kuwalongeleza Waizilaeli wambuyazangu. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Ivo nivo vilekile hilombeza kudugana no kusimuila na nyuwe, kwaviya hikakigwa mp'hingu kwe mbuli ye kawiilo idyo dya Izilaeli.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Woho niyo wamgamba, “Suwe hakihokele baluwa yoyose ilaile Yudeya, naho hahali mndugu yeyose abuile aha kukink'ha ulosi ukint'hile, hegu kulonga chochose kiihile mwa weye. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Mna nekikaunga kive zifanyanyi zako we mwenye, izimbuli zimwo mtwi wako, kwaviya kimanya kugamba kila hant'hu want'hu wasimuila hevikuligana ne difyo dyenyu.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Basi wapangaga naye zuwa dyedi dya kudugana naye, naho wengi niyo wabula uko ekalaga. Kukongela mtondo mpaka kisingi Paulo naakawasimuila ulosi wo Useuta wa Mnungu, akageza kuwatenda wazumile zikulongwa mwa Yesu kwa kulawa mwe vitabu ve miko va Musa na va walotezi. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Want'hu wamwenga mwa woho nawahuwila zimbuli zakwe, mna wamwenga hawahuwile. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Basi niyo kwanda na kupangana kwe zifanyanyi mgati mwawe, umwo Paulo eze alonge mbuli ino, “Muye ywa Mnungu nakalonga vedi kwombokela kwo mlotezi Isaya mwe mbuli ya wakale wenyu! <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Kwaviya nakagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">‘Ita kawagambe want'hu awa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">Nomtegeleze no kwiva, mna homkombaganye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">nomkaule no kukaula, mna homuwone,<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Kwaviya ubala wa want'hu awa ubwalata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">naho wasita magutwi yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">no kufinya ameso yawe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">Wanase kukaula niyo waona na meso yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">hegu wanase kutegeleza niyo weva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">no kukombaganya kwa ubala wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">wanase kunihitukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">niyo nawahonya.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Paulo niyo agamba, “Elo manyeni kugamba ulosi udya wa Mnungu wo kukombola want'hu, wigalwa kwa want'hu hi Wayahudi woho na wautegeleze!” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Paulo eze alonge ivi, Wayahudi wahalawaga wakahigana woho kwa woho.<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Kwa myaka miidi migima Paulo naakekala mwe nyumba apangile yehe mwenye, niyo awahokela wose wezile kumlamsa. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Nakanda akabilikiza Mbuli yo Useuta wa Mnungu, na kuhiniza mwa zumbe yesu Kilisito kwa weduvi haheina mafingizo yoyose.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>